 production URL and added a `getUrl` method for constructing API endpoints.\n- Created `AuthAPIService` for handling user authentication, including login, registration, and logout functionalities.\n- Implemented `LogoutService` for managing logout requests.\n- Developed `User` service to fetch user profile information.\n- Added `footer` component with HTML structure and styles.\n- Created `header` component with navigation and user interaction features.\n- Introduced `ErrorsService` for centralized error handling and user notifications.\n- Established `ApiBaseService` for making HTTP requests with error handling.\n- Added models for authentication responses and API responses.\n- Implemented unit tests for `header` and `footer` components.","tree":{"sha":"d12c5b726512d67697e46ce03c8d05cf6f04a35d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hazem-Alyaari/shell/git/trees/d12c5b726512d67697e46ce03c8d05cf6f04a35d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hazem-Alyaari/shell/git/commits/2ff886926fd74f9294936d15bfb2c66eabe64248","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133292426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hazem-Alyaari","id":133292426,"login":"Hazem-Alyaari","node_id":"U_kgDOB_Hhig","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hazem-Alyaari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github