:"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(http): permitir headers custom en UncommonResponse.redirect\n\nNecesario para que una redirección cacheable (Cache-Control) salga por el camino de excepción:\nel `options.cache` declarativo de @RegisterEndpoint sólo se aplica en la respuesta normal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"338ae23684bdc63eaed4d431be875d54d108775e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/338ae23684bdc63eaed4d431be875d54d108775e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/b34ee2bdb565f6ab78be7998ea6e83bf9cf183b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/b34ee2bdb565f6ab78be7998ea6e83bf9cf183b4","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKGIzNGVlMmJkYjU2NWY2YWI3OGJlNzk5OGVhNmU4M2JmOWNmMTgzYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/0d37db3ed43c25e59d2934bcdedb052d59d