ación de documentos y alta del preset adc-generators\n\n- Tab «Legales» en el panel de administración (estado por documento, deriva de\n  texto, PDF, anuncio y adopción) contra el nuevo `LegalDocsService`.\n- `scripts/legal-check.ts` (dentro de `extra-checks`) reemplaza al hook\n  `pre-commit` del preset help: sella cada documento por hash y distingue\n  corrección de versión con preaviso.\n- Contratos compartidos nuevos: `@common/types/legal`, `@common/types/generators`\n  y los errores tipados `LegalError` / `GeneratorsError`; recurso y permisos\n  `legal`.\n- Alta del preset `adc-generators` (devPort 3050) en `.presets.txt`, workspace y\n  `ports.csv`, con su icono en la UI library y su entrada en el menú de apps.\n- El subdominio de los generadores es `gen`, no `tools`: `tools` queda libre para\n  otra app y el nombre visible pasa a «Generadores».\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"767c212f479fd39dc3434e1ee748c1939870f989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/767c212f479fd39dc3434e1ee748c1939870f989"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/cfa66d094bde3238e5b5a7b607c402fcd3f2b55c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/cfa66d094bde3238e5b5a7b607c402fcd3f2b55c","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKGNmYTY2ZDA5NGJkZTMyMzhlNWI1YTdiNjA3YzQwMmZjZDNmMmI1NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/f516c03835905fe0e189596f0a744e58bb98ede4","sha":"f516c03835905fe0e189596f0a744e58bb98ede4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/f516c03835905fe0e189596f0a744e58bb98ede4"}],"sha":"cfa66d094bde3238e5b5a7b607c402fcd3f2b55c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/cfa66d094bde3238e5b5a7b607c402fcd3f2b55c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/f516c03835905fe0e189596f0a744e58bb98ede4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T07:59:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T08:06:20Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abigaíl Palmero"},"message":"fix(http): contener dentro de su base los estáticos del dev server y el listado de file-storage\n\nLos dos plugins de Vite que sirven estáticos (`/ui/` de las UI libraries y el\nfallback de `common/public/`) hacían `path.join(dir, req.url)`. `req.url` es el\npath crudo del cliente: un `GET /../../../../../../etc/passwd` sale del\ndirectorio y se sirve el archivo. Sólo afecta al dev server —producción resuelve\npor `resolveSafeStaticPath`, que ya contiene—, pero el traversal era real.\n\n`file-storage.list()` tenía el mismo agujero: `save`/`load`/`delete` se defienden\ncon `basename`, pero el listado admite subdirectorios y no comprobaba contención.\n\nAmbos pasan ahora por `isInsideBase`, decodificando antes de resolver (si no,\n`%2e%2e` esquiva la comprobación pero abre el mismo archivo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J1iJKyzQ6q3p6EXxmbeN8i","tree":{"sha":"ecc6746e8d34b8488ab2509a13c4281d2ade439d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/ecc6746e8d34b8488ab2509a13c4281d2ade439d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/f516c03835905fe0e189596f0a744e58bb98ede4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"