},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/8a9e7745f42c071b4802fe9a3d23f5775fa25e14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T00:13:15Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T00:13:15Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(ui-library): cursor-pointer en campana de notificaciones y engranaje del header\n\nTailwind v4 dejó de forzar pointer en <button> en su preflight; se agrega\nexplícito como en el resto de los botones clickeables del header.\n\nfeat(identity): sortBy/sortDir en el cliente de listUsers y en ListOptions\ncompartido, para el ordenamiento server-side de la tabla de usuarios.","tree":{"sha":"653ffef692027dbfbf998d3f746609eda3447091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/653ffef692027dbfbf998d3f746609eda3447091"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/8a9e7745f42c071b4802fe9a3d23f5775fa25e14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/8a9e7745f42c071b4802fe9a3d23f5775fa25e14","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDhhOWU3NzQ1ZjQyYzA3MWI0ODAyZmU5YTNkMjNmNTc3NWZhMjVlMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6","sha":"ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6"}],"sha":"8a9e7745f42c071b4802fe9a3d23f5775fa25e14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/8a9e7745f42c071b4802fe9a3d23f5775fa25e14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T23:22:20Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T23:22:20Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(http): dejar de publicar el shell del SPA bajo decenas de URLs\n\nSearch Console reportaba el mismo `index.html` indexado como \"duplicada sin\ncanónica\" en `/adc-platform/<app>/`, en rutas viejas y en sondeos ajenos, y en\nlos tres hosts a la vez. Dos causas, las dos acá:\n\n- El import map inline publicaba una entrada `\"@app/\": \"/<ns>/<app>/\"` por cada\n  módulo del namespace. En producción sólo están montados ahí los módulos SIN\n  `hosting` (los demás viven en su propio host), así que esas URLs resolvían al\n  `index.html` del `spaFallback` —200 text/html donde el navegador espera un\n  módulo— y de paso le entregaban al crawler una lista de directorios para\n  visitar. Ahora el map se poda: en prod entra sólo lo alcanzable bajo el\n  prefijo. La federación entre apps no depende de esto (`loadRemoteComponent`\n  arma la URL del `remoteEntry.js` contra el origin de la app).\n- El `spaFallback` contestaba el `index.html` para CUALQUIER path, incluidos los\n  que piden un archivo concreto. Un `.js` que devuelve HTML con 200 es un error\n  mudo: falla por MIME, el import map parece resolver y los buscadores indexan\n  el shell bajo la URL del asset. Ahora eso da 404; las rutas del cliente no\n  cambian, y los slugs con punto (`node.js-basics`) siguen contando como ruta.\n\nAdemás `registerNoIndexPrefix()` marca un prefijo de URL como infraestructura:\ntodo lo que cuelgue de él sale con `X-Robots-Tag: noindex`, y la UI federation\nregistra el suyo (`/<namespace>/`). Vive en el provider y no en el SEOService por\nlo mismo que el robots.txt: ese preset es opcional. Es `noindex` y no `Disallow`\nporque el prefijo tiene que seguir siendo rastreable —de ahí cuelgan el loader de\ni18n y los assets de la UI library, sin los cuales no se puede renderizar la\npágina— y porque una URL ya indexada sólo sale del índice si el crawler puede\nvolver a entrar a leer el `noindex`.\n\nEl provider pasa de 1245 líneas a 274 de fachada: el estado va a colaboradores\n(`routing/`, `static/`), el trabajo por request a `dispatch/` y lo que se instala\nuna vez a `setup/`. Sin cambios de comportamiento salvo que el `X-Robots-Tag` del\nprefijo ahora también sella las respuestas de los gates de acceso. De paso baja\nla complejidad cognitiva del handler estático (19 -> <15) y `looksLikeStaticAsset`\nresuelve por Set en vez de una alternancia de 32 ramas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf5818610485c191426a952d8d3f645660f7d26d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/cf5818610485c191426a952d8d3f645660f7d26d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKGFkMzRjYWMxMjFmYTRhNzk0NDViNjFiMmMwYmQzNTU3ZDI1Zjg0YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb","sha":"104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb"}],"sha":"ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/ad34cac121fa4a79445b61b2c0bd3557d25f84a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T20:38:02Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T20:38:02Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(kernel): no cargar barriles internos como módulos en los `change` del watcher\n\nLos watchers de capa entregan CUALQUIER `index.ts` dentro de `WATCH_DEPTH`, así que los\nbarriles internos de un módulo llegan igual que su índice real. El camino `add` ya los\ndescartaba con `isModuleRoot` (package.json/config.json); el camino `change` no validaba\nnada y `ModuleRegistrar` les inventa el nombre con `basename(dirname)`, cargándolos como\nmódulo propio.\n\nCon nombre que choca contra un grupo de la capa el fallo es ruidoso pero inofensivo\n(`providers/http/fastify-server/security/index.ts` -> \"No se pudo resolver Provider:\nsecurity@latest\", visto en cada arranque de prod). Sin choque es SILENCIOSO: hay 21\nbarriles `dao/`, `domain/`, `endpoints/` y `topology/` en presets que el VersionResolver\nencuentra por nombre y cargaría como services.\n\nSe aplica el mismo criterio que `add` en ambas ramas de `#layerEventHandlers`; para eso\n`isModuleRoot` pasa a ser pública.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0bc2b5c099650386b38f4917e5c19901ed6e604","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/f0bc2b5c099650386b38f4917e5c19901ed6e604"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDEwNGJmZWI0YmY2NDMwNDA0NmMyNzBmMGMzZGViNDVlYjZiOWY3Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940","sha":"d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940"}],"sha":"104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/104bfeb4bf64304046c270f0c3deb45eb6b9f7cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:28:25Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:28:25Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(email): dominios mailed-by/signed-by + cifrado de transporte en el webhook entrante\n\n- adc_basic_spam extrae el dominio que SPF autenticó (mailed-by) y el d= de la firma\n  DKIM válida (signed-by), sólo cuando el veredicto respectivo es pass.\n- adc_inbound_webhook reporta el cifrado de la sesión SMTP (versión + cipher) cuando\n  hubo STARTTLS, y ahora omite auth por completo en la entrega interna del propio\n  email-service (IP privada): antes se mostraba \"sin verificar\" en cada correo entre\n  usuarios de la plataforma, cuando no hay remitente externo que autenticar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08db26bcbc54f77b1884dec547940986ed493b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/08db26bcbc54f77b1884dec547940986ed493b69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKGQ2ZTIxZTAyYjYxMWJkMjU4MDQ3OTM4NTJjNmU4MWMzODU4MmY5NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/380d053fb65be31c1f415ee050b67dc3c5146ece","sha":"380d053fb65be31c1f415ee050b67dc3c5146ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/380d053fb65be31c1f415ee050b67dc3c5146ece"}],"sha":"d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/d6e21e02b611bd25804793852c6e81c38582f940"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/380d053fb65be31c1f415ee050b67dc3c5146ece/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:28:16Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:28:16Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(ui-federation): gate de acceso por rol para módulos UI + higiene de build\n\n- uiModule.access (roles/requireAuth/globalOnly) cierra el contenido de un módulo\n  (HTML/JS/assets) antes de servir un byte: sin el rol, redirect a adc-error/unauthorized.\n  Se evalúa tanto en el provider HTTP (prod) como en el dev server de rspack (dev),\n  con la misma resolución de roles que los permisos.\n- uiModule.federationAccess protege el chunk de un expose de Module Federation en su\n  propio host (los remotes se sirven desde quien los expone, no desde el consumidor).\n  Los exposes ahora compilan con nombre de chunk estable para poder gatearlos por ruta.\n- Higiene de artefactos publicados: Stencil deja de generar source maps en producción\n  (llevaban el TypeScript fuente completo vía sourcesContent), se poda cjs/collection/\n  types/custom-elements del directorio servido, y el servidor bloquea esos artefactos\n  con 404 aunque queden en disco (ADC_SERVE_SOURCEMAPS los reactiva para depurar).\n- [contenthash] en los bundles de producción + Cache-Control derivado del nombre:\n  immutable para lo hasheado, no-cache para HTML/remoteEntry.js/manifiestos de nombre\n  fijo, 1h para el resto. Permite desplegar sin purgar caché de borde.\n- Aplicado a los tres paneles de administración (adc-admin-panel, adc-modules-manager,\n  adc-network) y al panel de moderación federado de adc-drive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dffeb5fef09418ef4a401d4dafb5c2c839f711fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/dffeb5fef09418ef4a401d4dafb5c2c839f711fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/380d053fb65be31c1f415ee050b67dc3c5146ece","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/