tps://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/8bcb69b7545ec2d772114d1344efd4e6848f17b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T00:05:19Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T00:05:19Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix: cuentas OAuth sin salida para estrenar contraseña, y callout partido\n\n- identity: `change-password` exigía `currentPassword` siempre, mientras\n  change-email y change-username ya exceptuaban a las cuentas OAuth vía\n  `#assertSelfReauth`. Como su password es aleatoria y nadie la conoce, una\n  cuenta creada por Discord no podía estrenar una nunca. Pasa por el mismo\n  helper: con `currentPassword` se verifica igual, sin ella sólo se acepta si la\n  cuenta es OAuth. El aviso de seguridad se sigue disparando.\n\n- ui-library: `adc-callout` con `role=\"status\"` renderiza en un `<output>`, que\n  es display:inline de fábrica, y el recuadro se partía en un fragmento por\n  renglón —borde, fondo y padding cortados— en vez de envolver el texto. `block`\n  explícito en las tres ramas.\n\n- network: scope nuevo `network.routing` (bit 32) para la tab de Routing del\n  panel de red, + las CLOUDFLARE_* en el manifiesto de env y los .example. El\n  token va en secrets.env; el permiso mínimo es Zone:DNS:Edit.\n\n- CLAUDE.md: convención de comentarios cortos (el porqué no evidente, no la\n  prosa de lo que hace la línea de abajo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1407115ace36b6409e80293ca036d94bdec94611","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/1407115ace36b6409e80293ca036d94bdec94611"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/8bcb69b7545ec2d772114d1344efd4e6848f17b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/8bcb69b7545ec2d772114d1344efd4e6848f17b0","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDhiY2I2OWI3NTQ1ZWMyZDc3MjExNGQxMzQ0ZWZkNGU2ODQ4ZjE3YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/9c71485947f94fc17b67b61ec1770ac5e8cc10b8","sha":"9c71485947f94fc17b67b61ec1770ac5e8cc10b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/9c71485947f94fc17b67b61ec1770ac5e8cc10b8"}],"sha":"8bcb69b7545ec2d772114d1344efd4e6848f17b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/8bcb69b7545ec2d772114d1344efd4e6848f17b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api