_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/5bc8e28f31951c1a74f1bd445570a80515ead5b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:37:57Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:37:57Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(web): robots/noindex, favicon de marca, GPC y change-password\n\n- robots.txt por host en UIFederation (no en el preset SEO, que es opcional):\n  host con SEO publica su sitemap, host interno pide Disallow. Los comodines\n  siempre Disallow: sirven el mismo contenido bajo infinitos subdominios.\n- X-Robots-Tag: noindex derivado de `enableSEO`, no declarado app por app.\n  Disallow no desindexa; esto sí. Fail-closed: una app nueva nace fuera del\n  índice y entra sólo si alguien lo pide.\n- El favicon pasa a ser SIEMPRE la marca de la plataforma; los iconos por app\n  quedan para instalar (manifest + apple-touch). Iconos de la home rehechos\n  desde el logo, sin el glifo de \"apps\" encima.\n- scripts/generate-app-icons.mjs: genera los 5 PNG + manifest desde el glifo\n  `adc-icon-app-*` de la UI library o desde una imagen. No copia el dibujo, lo\n  extrae, así que no puede divergir del componente.\n- /.well-known/change-password (W3C) → 302 a la página de seguridad de la\n  cuenta. Ruta global: el gestor de contraseñas pregunta desde cualquier origen\n  donde guardó la credencial.\n- Beacon de Cloudflare inyectado por la plataforma y no por el borde, salteado\n  cuando el visitante manda `Sec-GPC: 1`. Con el RUM automático el beacon sale\n  después de este proceso y la señal no se puede honrar. Se publica gpc.json.\n- llms.txt en la home, como índice de las apps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34551d229225c256d6995ae17f0bdec5b28af282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/34551d229225c256d6995ae17f0bdec5b28af282"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/5bc8e28f31951c1a74f1bd445570a80515ead5b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/5bc8e28f31951c1a74f1bd445570a80515ead5b5","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDViYzhlMjhmMzE5N