ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:39Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"chore: README de file-storage, aislar el Mongo de las apps de prueba e ignorar arca/\n\n`file-storage` escribe en el disco local del proceso: queda documentado como\nlocal al nodo, porque con varios nodos lo que guarde uno no lo ve el otro.\n\nLas apps de prueba leían `MONGO_OPTIONS`, la misma variable que el clúster real,\nasí que apuntarlas a otro lado obligaba a mover el de todos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a492ba0c7fad1683e3799b7a05b382f778c1cb52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/a492ba0c7fad1683e3799b7a05b382f778c1cb52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/6f2b9f231f0cc4fac19302792bb4a611f031f8f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/6f2b9f231f0cc4fac19302792bb4a611f031f8f6","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDZmMmI5ZjIzMWYwY2M0ZmFjMTkzMDI3OTJiYjRhNjExZjAzMWY4ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c","sha":"36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c"}],"sha":"6f2b9f231f0cc4fac19302792bb4a611f031f8f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/6f2b9f231f0cc4fac19302792bb4a611f031f8f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:39Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:39Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"docs(legal): cuarta revisión, de cara a la escalabilidad horizontal\n\nSe hace ahora porque los cuatro documentos todavía no rigen y nadie aceptó nada:\ncada una de estas frases habría exigido una enmienda con 30 días de preaviso el\ndía que se encienda el segundo nodo.\n\n- §7: las filas de infraestructura propia admiten varios servidores replicados\n  (la redacción anterior daba a entender una sola máquina).\n- §5: los logs son \"de cada proceso\", y se compromete a no escribirlos a disco ni\n  mandarlos a terceros — que es lo que obliga a que el panel agregue por HTTP en\n  vivo y no persista nada.\n- §6: régimen de réplicas y copias de seguridad (cifradas, 30 días, sin restaurar\n  datos ya suprimidos).\n- §8: anuncio previo y re-declaración ante el RNBD si alguna vez hubiera\n  infraestructura propia fuera del país. Es un compromiso, no una autorización.\n\nEl runbook de respuesta a brechas se va al repo privado: describe procedimiento\ninterno y contactos, no comportamiento del código.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6829d5c3e69828a92f6c75b64c2447c32f7cd85b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/6829d5c3e69828a92f6c75b64c2447c32f7cd85b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDM2YWEwNGE4ODkwNTQ3YThiMmY1ODg4Nzg4MWUxM2U0MTg5YWFkMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4","sha":"0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4"}],"sha":"36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/36aa04a8890547a8b2f58887881e13e4189aad2c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:24Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:24Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(security): acotar la vigencia de las DEK cacheadas\n\nUna sesión de subida o descarga hace muchos accesos seguidos y no tiene sentido\nre-desenvolver la clave en cada uno, pero la caché no expiraba: con varios nodos,\nel que no ejecutó la purga podía seguir descifrando indefinidamente. Cinco\nminutos, y re-desenvolver cuesta un `findById` más un AES-GCM.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6582ac030b6b3191e2dc66f258b20b15a2d5d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/a6582ac030b6b3191e2dc66f258b20b15a2d5d26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDBhMzczOGZiYWVlY2RmODg2ZWQ5NTZmNWMyMWE5YTljYWE1ZDQwYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8","sha":"9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8"}],"sha":"0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/0a3738fbaeecdf886ed956f5c21a9a9caa5d40c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:24Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:24Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"refactor(identity): quitar el URI de caché por región\n\nEstaba en el schema y era editable desde el panel, pero ningún código lo leía:\nprometía una separación de caché por organización que no existe. Redis en esta\nplataforma se reparte por SITIO, que es un eje de latencia, no de partición por\norganización, así que no hay nada que implementar del otro lado.\n\nLa purga es idempotente y lo que se guardaba era una credencial que nadie iba a\nrotar. Con el schema en strict, mongoose ya descarta la clave en create y en\nupdate, así que no puede volver a persistirse por accidente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"856a841f296e8e8bec12ba9c1831451a40a0a0e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/856a841f296e8e8bec12ba9c1831451a40a0a0e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDk4NjliZTQ3OGM3MzJlY2FhOTdiOGRlNTI3ZTM2ZjUxZDZmOGZkZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58","sha":"6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58"}],"sha":"9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/9869be478c732ecaa97b8de527e36f51d6f8fde8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:08Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:08Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(session): estado de OAuth y claves de firma compartidos entre nodos\n\nEl `state` de OAuth vivía en un Map del proceso: con dos nodos, la vuelta del\nproveedor que aterrizara en el otro fallaba la validación. Pasa a Redis, con la\nclave hasheada y consumo de un solo uso garantizado por `SET NX`. El Map queda\nsólo como respaldo cuando no hay Redis.\n\nEl `KeyStore` rotaba por nodo, así que N nodos rotaban N veces. La rotación pasa\na ser un turno con lease; el que lo pierde adopta las claves persistidas en vez\nde quedarse con las suyas, que es lo que dejaría sesiones válidas en un nodo e\ninválidas en el otro.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8601b69d15cec395af69091fa09e3d07ff208e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/8601b69d15cec395af69091fa09e3d07ff208e87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDY4Njc3ODcyNTViYTU4ZmRkZjE3MzJkMjY4MjExMzBkOTVlMmNmNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8","sha":"2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8"}],"sha":"6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/6867787255ba58fddf1732d26821130d95e2cf58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:08Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:39:08Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(providers): fuga de conexiones de Mongo y reconexión de Redis\n\nMongo: el refcount subía en cada reconexión sin bajar nunca, y una entrada caída\ndel pool compartido se reemplazaba por una nueva, dejando la vieja viva contra el\nhost anterior. Mongoose reconecta sobre el MISMO objeto `Connection`, así que el\narreglo es no reemplazarlo y esperarlo — y por eso no hubo que tocar ninguno de\nlos ~15 servicios que lo usan.\n\nRedis: el cliente se rendía tras 10 reintentos y dejaba un cliente muerto en el\npool compartido, invisible porque el aviso salía a nivel debug. Sesiones, rate\nlimit y leases quedaban rotos hasta reiniciar el proceso.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a70a85b2f47c0dd70709980adc2498eeec4ed575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/a70a85b2f47c0dd70709980adc2498eeec4ed575"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDJmYTM3ZmMyNTU4MDg5MjQ0M2E4NmUyM2RkYzcxZDQ4YjViNDYwZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db","sha":"fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db"}],"sha":"2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/2fa37fc25580892443a86e23ddc71d48b5b460e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:55Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:55Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(operations): todo trabajo periódico pasa por un lease de líder\n\nCon dos nodos, cada `setInterval` que escribe corre dos veces: se duplican las\nmuestras de recursos, las purgas de retención y los barridos de expirados. Son\n~15 temporizadores y ninguno estaba preparado para eso.\n\nDos primitivas, no una:\n\n- `withLeadership` es por turno: se toma, se corre y se suelta. Para un barrido\n  que empieza y termina.\n- `claimLeadership` sostiene un ROL y lo renueva la propia llamada, sin\n  temporizador de renovación: el silencio lo libera. El planificador de tareas\n  ociosas lo reclama DESPUÉS del chequeo de ocio, así que un nodo saturado no\n  llega a renovar y lo suelta solo, en vez de retener un rol que no puede\n  ejercer.\n\nLas tareas que sí tienen que correr en todos los nodos se marcan `perNode` en\nvez de quedar fuera del planificador.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e74be3ad329a475425e46927eb5d4a2941494b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/e74be3ad329a475425e46927eb5d4a2941494b84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKGZlM2FhNzQwY2M0MzI3MGZmYTFjMjJiNWE4NDQ4NWE5YTczMWYzZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d","sha":"3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d"}],"sha":"fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/fe3aa740cc43270ffa1c22b5a84485a9a731f3db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:42Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:42Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(cluster): reenvío entre nodos y consistencia de artefactos de UI\n\nEl gateway no registra un catch-all (rompería el matcher): se registra como\nfallback para los vhosts que este nodo no sirve. Hay afinidad obligatoria donde\nel fan-out no alcanza —el túnel de dispositivos hace RPC bidireccional contra\nuna conexión que vive en un nodo concreto—, preferencia por sitio para no cruzar\nel WAN por nada, y anti-bucle por cabecera.\n\nEl motor del proxy sale del gateway S3 a `@common/utils`. La pata saliente se\nreescribe sobre `fetch`: el `ClientRequest` de `node:http` de Bun **nunca emite\n`drain`**, así que el `pipeline` se clavaba al pasar el MiB. `fetch` +\n`Readable.toWeb` + `duplex: \"half\"` es el único transporte que termina y además\nrespeta la contrapresión. Verificado con 1 GiB y con cuatro subidas en paralelo.\n\nConsistencia de artefactos: dos nodos con builds distintos sirviendo el mismo\nvhost dan 404 intermitentes de chunks. El `build-id` sale del sha desplegado más\nel hash de la config de UI, el primario publica el vigente y el nodo\ndesactualizado responde 503 en `/healthz`, así que el balanceador lo drena solo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4240a2c100467393bba29e916c24bcf47340b53c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/4240a2c100467393bba29e916c24bcf47340b53c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDNiZWJlNzAwZmFlMTMxNWJlYzZhYTJmZjhjOGNhZDEwMzMxM2UxMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55","sha":"18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55"}],"sha":"3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/3bebe700fae1315bec6aa2ff8c8cad103313e10d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:29Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:29Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(cluster): identidad de nodo, roles asimétricos y bus entre nodos\n\nRoles asimétricos en vez de nodos simétricos: el primario es el único con\nwatchers, detector de módulos, git y docker; los secundarios cargan módulos y\nsirven HTTP con esos cuatro subsistemas apagados. Evita reescribir el\norquestador, que es donde está el 80 % del riesgo.\n\n- `ADC_NODE_ID` es inmutable (es clave en Redis, en el audit y en las\n  afinidades); `ADC_NODE_NAME` es sólo etiqueta y se cambia sin reiniciar.\n- Registro de nodos en Redis con TTL, y la etiqueta persistida en Mongo gana\n  sobre el entorno.\n- Fan-out por un exchange de RabbitMQ y no por Redis pub/sub: el cliente de\n  Redis de Bun no expone `publish`/`subscribe`, así que sería cambiar de cliente.\n  El bus es best-effort y el emisor no recibe su propio eco.\n- Primer consumidor: las resoluciones memoizadas del registry. El unload es por\n  nodo, así que sin difundir la invalidación un deploy asimétrico deja a un nodo\n  resolviendo contra el código viejo.\n- `tryGetMyProvider`: un broker caído tiene que costar la funcionalidad que\n  depende de él, no el arranque del módulo entero.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f438f627b94cb5b2ae8802c9ba22cb19bf4976f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/1f438f627b94cb5b2ae8802c9ba22cb19bf4976f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDE4YTBlMTYxMzE3MTJmMzY0NTM2NzllMzQ3NTUwNzMxZDE1YThlNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e","sha":"56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e"}],"sha":"18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/18a0e16131712f36453679e347550731d15a8e55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:29Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:29Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(s3-gateway): proxy S3 por vhost en el propio proceso\n\nEl navegador entra por un vhost de la plataforma y el object storage se queda en\nloopback, sin nginx delante. El proxy es streaming (`reply.hijack()` + pipe\ncrudo): no bufferiza el cuerpo, así que una subida grande no se come la memoria\ndel proceso.\n\n`Content-Disposition` entra en los headers permitidos por CORS porque el PUT\npresignado lo lleva firmado en SigV4: sin él, el preflight bloquea la subida.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"112309a9a1920a702f9b71bfc016c6ff556881f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/112309a9a1920a702f9b71bfc016c6ff556881f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDU2ZjU2YTc5N2QyZmNiMDA1MmViYjAyNTFlMDI3NTRmZTVhMjAwMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24","sha":"195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24"}],"sha":"56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/56f56a797d2fcb0052ebb0251e02754fe5a2002e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:11Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:38:11Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(infra): reemplazar MinIO por Garage y acotar el compose por nodo\n\nMinIO community quedó archivado en febrero de 2026 (sin parches) y nunca\npermitió sumar discos a un pool existente, que es justo lo que hace falta para\ncrecer en caliente. Garage sí, y reparte una copia por zona.\n\n- `adc-garage-core` con su provisionador: layout, clave de servicio y buckets,\n  idempotente en cada `compose up`. Corre sin privilegios y no escribe en ningún\n  lado: comparte el volumen de metadatos, donde vive la clave privada de RPC.\n- Garage impone el formato de las credenciales (`GK`+24 hex / 64 hex) y no tiene\n  bucket policies: los permisos son por par clave↔bucket, y crear buckets exige\n  `key allow --create-bucket` o `ensureBucket()` falla con 403 al arrancar.\n- Mongo pasa a replica set de un miembro: desbloquea transacciones hoy y\n  convierte \"sumar un nodo\" en un `rs.add()` en caliente mañana.\n- `ADC_INFRA_COMPOSE` acota qué levanta cada nodo. Sin esto, un segundo kernel\n  pone en pie un segundo Mongo y un segundo Garage vacíos, sin avisar.\n\nLos módulos dejan de repetir el endpoint y las credenciales en su `config.json`:\nel default vive sólo en el provider. Cuatro copias del mismo valor y un cambio de\nmotor que actualiza una sola es exactamente cómo se rompió la descarga de Drive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d99181adc69f869a01b236f2475fb9cf1aa9f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/6d99181adc69f869a01b236f2475fb9cf1aa9f3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDE5NWZjMjhhMmM5Yzc1ZTE5ZWU2OGNlMjM3ZTY0NDY0N2M2ZWVkMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/ccd4232494854fdbeba1e3a71c6b1a943bb1bb6d","sha":"ccd4232494854fdbeba1e3a71c6b1a943bb1bb6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/ccd4232494854fdbeba1e3a71c6b1a943bb1bb6d"}],"sha":"195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/195fc28a2c9c75e19ee68ce237e644647c6eed24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2