received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/3e52c87c85e93933f05dfc2a703ab272b4893b73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T23:54:36Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T23:54:36Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"chore(cleanup): anonymizeByUploader en adjuntos + lint sobre presets + limpieza de exports knip\n\nAttachmentsManager gana anonymizeByUploader (contracara de forceDeleteByOwner para el\ncontenido que sobrevive a una baja) y aggregateUsageByUser ya no imputa a nadie los\nadjuntos blanqueados. `bun run lint` ahora cubre `presets` además de `src`, con globals\nde navegador y no-restricted-globals/imports (Bun/process/node:*) para separar el runtime\nde servidor del de browser dentro del mismo tsconfig de app. De paso, exports sin\nconsumidores externos (detectados por knip) pasan a locales, se corrige el pepper de\nidentityHash (ya no hace falta el fallback a Bun.env), se saca el DEV_ORG_ID duplicado,\nse actualizan los hashes de privacy/cookies por los cambios de RNBD y STUN, y se bumpean\nmongoose/typescript/typescript-eslint.","tree":{"sha":"b52518c051b1c9dab27c8a80b8561aed9b0ac571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/b52518c051b1c9dab27c8a80b8561aed9b0ac571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/3e52c87c85e93933f05dfc2a703ab272b4893b73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","event