ithub.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/de299da7ce3903c0b839e2558aceeb54a3aa550b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:40Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:40Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(legal): tickets de requerimientos de autoridades públicas + retención de tickets\n\nNuevo SupportTicketType \"authority\" (judiciales/administrativos/regulatorios),\naceptado sin sesión como los de datos/menor, con plantilla que exige oficio\nformal y devuelve los pedidos informales. SUPPORT_TICKET_RETENTION fija\nplazos de anonimización/purga por tipo desde closedAt (los que hoy publica\n/privacy §5): minor además borra el cuerpo, que por diseño de su plantilla\ncontiene la identidad de un menor y su vínculo familiar. Se actualiza el hash\nde privacy/cookies para reflejar estos plazos, que ya no se nombra PBKDF2 y\nla baja de terceros del CDN de React/avatares.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e182f4ae4e29e341facb64224dd0c6ce0a223ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/e182f4ae4e29e341facb64224dd0c6ce0a223ac1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/de299da7ce3903c0b839e2558aceeb54a3aa550b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https