rs/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/62e5e4fc8e0f12571062ac926f885af1a21d4f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:30Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:30Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(comments): export de comentarios propios para datos personales\n\nlistByAuthor (comments-utility) devuelve la actividad cruda de un autor —más\nrecientes primero, tope duro de 1000— para que el servicio host la use en su\nexport de datos personales (art. 14 Ley 25.326 / arts. 15 y 20 RGPD). Va tras\nla kernelKey del bounded context, sin permissionChecker ni hidratación de\nadjuntos/avatares (aplicaría permisos de terceros sobre lo que el titular\nescribió), y con un índice compuesto authorId+createdAt para no ordenar en\nmemoria.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae9433f388f81024150fa65f5801e2ba172582ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/ae9433f388f81024150fa65f5801e2ba172582ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/62e5e4fc8e0f12571062ac926f885af1a21d4f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith