s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/4cbbd6ea1a90cf15251aced9ca5ef72c146cd9b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:23Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:23Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"fix(security): reactivar cuentas tras vencer un ban temporal\n\nEl barrido de bans vencidos (cada 6h) desactivaba la fila pero nunca tocaba\nisActive del usuario, así que una sanción temporal se comportaba como\npermanente hasta un unban manual. Ahora deactivateExpiredBans devuelve los\nuserId afectados y ModerationService reactiva la cuenta en Identity, salvo\nque tenga una baja programada encima (ahí unbanUser resucitaría una cuenta\nque pidió su propia baja, o peor, con la cascada de purga ya iniciada).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbfd31d5253cc244b3740854b2b0202b2b8f7739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/fbfd31d5253cc244b3740854b2b0202b2b8f7739"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/4cbbd6ea1a90cf15251aced9ca5ef72c146cd9b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":271