:"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/d79f814d6443d20e99ad1ca1c4a5cc3d3a11a892/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:13Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T13:36:13Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(mail): plazos de retención de papelera/spam/logs + TLS del relay saliente\n\nNuevas env vars MAIL_TRASH_RETENTION_DAYS / MAIL_SPAM_RETENTION_DAYS /\nMAIL_SEND_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS (0 = nunca; inbox/enviados/borradores no se\ntocan) y MAIL_RELAY_TLS_INSECURE para aceptar el certificado del relay\nsaliente sin verificar (default false; loopback/LAN exento). EmailMessage\ngana trashedAt para marcar cuándo entró un mensaje a la papelera, ya que\nupdatedAt no sirve como ancla de retención: abrir el mensaje reiniciaría el\nplazo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb53d6ebbe0f50411ca70eb54786933f47e7beaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/eb53d6ebbe0f50411ca70eb54786933f47e7beaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/d79f814d6443d20e99ad1ca1c4a5cc3d3a11a892","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.