lcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/72e8eee8df0a0921a4d2b4e759ac045475c99d6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:56Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:56Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(ui-library): acceso al panel de módulos + hook useMediaQuery + polish\n\n- `adc-access-button`: entrada al panel de módulos (sólo admins globales).\n- `use-media-query.ts`: hook `useMediaQuery`/`useIsCompact` para layouts que\n  necesitan el corte `lg` de Tailwind en JS (elegir panel lateral vs. modal\n  full).\n- `adc-sidebar`: badge de contador con borde/color heredado en vez de la\n  clase `badge` fija, para que contraste igual en el ítem activo.\n- `accessibility.css`: checkboxes/radios usan el mínimo WCAG 2.5.8 (24px)\n  en vez del área táctil de 44px, que los deformaba.\n- `adc-mail-viewer.css`: el host acota su ancho y el `pre` scrollea en vez\n  de desbordar en mobile.\n- `adc-identity`: `uiName` \"Cuentas\" para agruparse en el panel de status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d0845c8dda99c821cdcfdea78889a9565ed313a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/0d0845c8dda99c821cdcfdea78889a9565ed313a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/72e8eee8df0a0921a4d2b4e759ac045475c99d6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":n