:"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/5266ca1c3b9a3211da42eb352efc303e2595a9d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:47Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:47Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(security): minimización y retención de bans levantados\n\nAl desactivarse un ban (manual o por vencimiento) se borran `emailMasks`,\n`lastLoginAt` y `reason`, y el registro entra en una ventana de retención\nde `BAN_RETENTION_DAYS` (180 por defecto) vía TTL de Mongo sobre\n`unbannedAt`. Un barrido cada 6h desactiva y minimiza los bans temporales\nya vencidos (antes sólo dejaban de aplicar en los lookups, pero seguían\n`active` y con los datos completos indefinidamente); al arrancar se hace\nbackfill de los que ya estaban inactivos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e01372282d14249b1a32a92d0cf8d878d9be9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/3e01372282d14249b1a32a92d0cf8d878d9be9d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/5266ca1c3b9a3211da42eb352efc303e2595a9d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/5266ca1c3b9a3211da42eb352efc303e2595a9d1","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDUyNjZjYTFjM2I5YTMyMTFkYTQyZWIzNTJlZmMzMDNlMjU5NWE5ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810","sha":"36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810"}],"sha":"5266ca1c3b9a3211da42eb352efc303e2595a9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/5266ca1c3b9a3211da42eb352efc303e2595a9d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:39Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:39Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(observability): métricas de endpoints en ventana móvil de 24h\n\nReemplaza el hash diario en Redis (día calendario, sin p90 ni desglose por\nstatus) por una ventana móvil: memoria (hot path, histograma logarítmico\nde latencia para p90) → Redis (hora en curso, `epm:<YYYY-MM-DDTHH>`) →\nMongo (`parts/metrics-store.ts`, horas ya cerradas, con TTL de retención).\n`getEndpointMetrics()` ya no toma un `day?: string`: siempre devuelve las\núltimas 24h archivadas más el tramo de la hora en curso, con `perHour`\npromediado sólo sobre horas efectivamente medidas y `errByStatus` por\ncódigo HTTP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"346cbf2001dc50cd3e98d52086d76ba82f62ead6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/346cbf2001dc50cd3e98d52086d76ba82f62ead6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810","node_id":"C_kwDOQNHjitoAKDM2ODc0YWJjNTU3MGUyNjliMTJlNmY0NDc4YjNjMzgwOTY4YTQ4MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commit/f0f518701349e48cbd75332a49273cdef765fd52","sha":"f0f518701349e48cbd75332a49273cdef765fd52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/f0f518701349e48cbd75332a49273cdef765fd52"}],"sha":"36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/36874abc5570e269b12e6f4478b3c380968a4810"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login":"abbytec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTYzNTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/commits/f0f518701349e48cbd75332a49273cdef765fd52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:31Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:59:31Z","email":"gpsmurfs@gmail.com","name":"Abbytec"},"message":"feat(identity): auto-avatar propio en vez de DiceBear\n\n`buildDicebearAvatar` llamaba a `api.dicebear.com` con el id/username como\nseed, filtrando a un tercero qué usuario mira cada visitante en casi todas\nlas pantallas. `buildDefaultAvatarUrl` reemplaza el fallback por 8 SVG\npropios (`common/public/avatars`), elegidos por un hash determinista de la\nseed — same-origin, sin red externa y con el mismo resultado en servidor y\nen cliente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f801847d4781f52369d87ac18d283ae782f67b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/trees/7f801847d4781f52369d87ac18d283ae782f67b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A-Digital-Cafe/ADC-platform/git/commits/f0f518701349e48cbd75332a49273cdef765fd52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27163541?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abbytec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abbytec","id":27163541,"login"