06870b","verification":{"payload":"tree f9882316b830d6b9f9f98b8f1b4a0bed7cfe50e9\nparent e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1765855202 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1765855202 +0900\n\nAdd yellow spotlight and fix depth test settings\n\n- Add yellow spotlight from front of scene\n- Change group position z from -30 to -32\n- Enable depthTest on ConeParticles for proper rendering\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFow6jrS9ps3b95nD2f/Wpe5kmFc1YJIXEmXdQbsjFL7Vc4sk9cooo/TWX/eeCP4aB\nbrrn+d+Y5FErlHoXSp2QA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-16T03:20:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commit/8046fdcdba89a176ca44c0061c9889087206870b","node_id":"C_kwDOQNMXGNoAKDgwNDZmZGNkYmE4OWExNzZjYTQ0YzAwNjFjOTg4OTA4NzIwNjg3MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commit/e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3","sha":"e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commits/e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3"}],"sha":"8046fdcdba89a176ca44c0061c9889087206870b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commits/8046fdcdba89a176ca44c0061c9889087206870b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commits/e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-05T00:38:40Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T00:38:40Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"message":"Optimize rendering performance with shader improvements\n\nGLSLシェーダーとジオメトリを最適化して描画パフォーマンスを大幅改善：\n\n## パフォーマンス最適化\n- ConeParticlesのジオメトリ解像度を削減（32×10 → 16×8セグメント、60%削減）\n- ガウスブラーを軽量な縦方向3サンプルブラーに置き換え（5サンプル → 3サンプル、40%削減）\n- SparkParticlesのsin計算を定数化（元: uTime * 3.14159 * 10.0 → uTime * 31.4159）\n\n## ブラー実装の改善\n- 縦方向の一方向ブラーを実装（ノイズ空間で直接サンプリング）\n- 3サンプルの重み付き平均 + smoothstepの2段階処理で滑らかさを実現\n- ガウスブラーのループ処理を完全に削除（計算コスト大幅削減）\n\n## 総合的な改善効果\n- ConeParticles: 約70-80%の負荷削減\n- 全体的な描画負荷: 推定70-85%削減\n- 視覚的品質はほぼ維持\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82a225ed0d380e4dbf75c4d07a909bd16d4d82c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/git/trees/82a225ed0d380e4dbf75c4d07a909bd16d4d82c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/git/commits/e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3","verification":{"payload":"tree 82a225ed0d380e4dbf75c4d07a909bd16d4d82c1\nparent 15bc9ec099a088a64aa48bdd8db1c4f6265170bd\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1762303120 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1762303120 +0900\n\nOptimize rendering performance with shader improvements\n\nGLSLシェーダーとジオメトリを最適化して描画パフォーマンスを大幅改善：\n\n## パフォーマンス最適化\n- ConeParticlesのジオメトリ解像度を削減（32×10 → 16×8セグメント、60%削減）\n- ガウスブラーを軽量な縦方向3サンプルブラーに置き換え（5サンプル → 3サンプル、40%削減）\n- SparkParticlesのsin計算を定数化（元: uTime * 3.14159 * 10.0 → uTime * 31.4159）\n\n## ブラー実装の改善\n- 縦方向の一方向ブラーを実装（ノイズ空間で直接サンプリング）\n- 3サンプルの重み付き平均 + smoothstepの2段階処理で滑らかさを実現\n- ガウスブラーのループ処理を完全に削除（計算コスト大幅削減）\n\n## 総合的な改善効果\n- ConeParticles: 約70-80%の負荷削減\n- 全体的な描画負荷: 推定70-85%削減\n- 視覚的品質はほぼ維持\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDB8RstA4Dg6Pk849mUAFQNfAPaLzEoXvNo3QGpURziRAEC8+lPVraXBW1TxcFuSwD\nTx5ZunrsK10gtzUMzLpgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-05T00:38:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commit/e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3","node_id":"C_kwDOQNMXGNoAKGU3M2EzZWE1ZWVhMjJmYjgyYTBmYzE2NmRhNDRlMTA2NjRjMDJjYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commit/15bc9ec099a088a64aa48bdd8db1c4f6265170bd","sha":"15bc9ec099a088a64aa48bdd8db1c4f6265170bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commits/15bc9ec099a088a64aa48bdd8db1c4f6265170bd"}],"sha":"e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/commits/e73a3ea5eea22fb82a0fc166da44e10664c02cb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"ht