ら正確に移植\n- ConeParticles に blending, uvScaleX/Y, startY/endY パラメータを追加\n- ワールド全体を [0, 1.6, -1] に配置（カメラ位置とアバター目線を考慮）\n- 透明な床を追加（y=0 で歩行可能）\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9d1478141e18329fb953c5d486bfa1de4421dad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/git/trees/e9d1478141e18329fb953c5d486bfa1de4421dad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-kirakira-world/git/commits/fdc8b67c60250b58dc73958a98a99f65581c1393","verification":{"payload":"tree e9d1478141e18329fb953c5d486bfa1de4421dad\nparent 64d0b655ea87d5850bbf70c8759ed111f306cdcb\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1761972769 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1761972769 +0900\n\nFix Newtype machu theme colors and positioning\n\n元コードと完全に一致するように修正：\n- Background fragment.glsl を元コードと同じ実装に変更（正しいグラデーション計算）\n- machu テーマの全カラーを元コードから正確に移植\n- ConeParticles に blending, uvScaleX/Y, startY/endY パラメータを追加\n- ワールド全体を [0, 1.6, -1] に配置（カメラ位置とアバター目線を考慮）\n- 透明な床を追加（y=0 で歩行可能）\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCr3SrkLzinBvoH4y/qbpmkgjldSkmD7AoxgSSYyX5FPazAXO4WtGtr0nXJlFs2rIe\nPLb3N62+HX6XLC7p80aws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-01T07:32:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-z