,{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68178042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/de52ef7512b0eea20b4fc35fd11b178337dadc64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:39:42Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:39:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(TASKBOLT-6a6d9eb9336b22c68a3c8315): manual Complete Sprint action (#54)\n\n* feat(TASKBOLT-6a6d9eb9336b22c68a3c8315): manual Complete Sprint button\n\nFrontend-only slice of the \"Complete Sprint\" story. Backend already\nsupports it — PATCH /sprints/:id accepts status via UpdateSprintDto and\nis already admin-gated via assertCanManageSprint — so this needed no\nAPI changes, just a button.\n\nShown on Active Sprint when the caller is a project admin\n(useProjectRole, same composable already used to gate sprint edit/\ndelete in SprintManagement/ProjectDetailPage) and either today is on\nor past the sprint''s endDate, or every task in the sprint is DONE or\nCLOSED (obsoleted tasks don''t block completion, consistent with how\nthey''re already excluded from the points total on this page).\n\nClicking confirms via window.confirm (matching the existing delete-\nconfirmation pattern elsewhere in this repo), calls the existing\nupdateSprint() service function with status: COMPLETED, and reloads —\nthe sprint no longer matches the ACTIVE filter so the page naturally\nfalls back to its existing \"no active sprint\" state.\n\nAuto-completing a sprint when its endDate passes (the backend cron\nhalf of the original AC) is out of scope here — tracked separately as\ntech debt.\n\n* feat(TASKBOLT-6a6d9eb9336b22c68a3c8315): mark-as-done button in SprintManagement\n\nSame \"Complete Sprint\" story, extended to the Configure page''s sprint\nlist — an admin can now mark an active sprint as done from there too,\nnot just from the Active Sprint board.\n\nShown per-row when the sprint is ACTIVE and its endDate is today or in\nthe past. Unlike the Active Sprint page''s button, there''s no \"all\ntasks done\" condition here — this list only fetches sprints, not their\ntasks, so that signal isn''t available (and wasn''t asked for here; the\ntask said \"today as equal as after sprint date\").\n\nEdit/Delete stay disabled for an active sprint exactly as before\n(activeSprintLocked) — marking as done is a distinct, deliberate\naction, not a general edit, so it''s not gated by that same lock.\n\nReuses the existing updateSprint() call and window.confirm() pattern\nalready used by confirmDelete() in this same file, and the\ntoast.sprintCompleted/sprintCompleteFailed keys added in the previous\ncommit for the Active Sprint page''s version of this button.\n\nUpdated tests/components/SprintManagement.test.ts: the existing\n\"disables edit/delete for an active sprint\" test asserted all buttons\nin the row were disabled, which broke once a 3rd (enabled) button\ncould appear — narrowed that assertion to the two locked buttons\nspecifically, and added 3 new tests covering the mark-as-done button''s\nvisibility across active/inactive and past/future-endDate combinations.","tree":{"sha":"dbb8d6dd0259814927409077202a9cc40e4805ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/dbb8d6dd0259814927409077202a9cc40e4805ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/de52ef7512b0eea20b4fc35fd11b178337dadc64","verification":{"payload":"tree dbb8d6dd0259814927409077202a9cc40e4805ae\nparent 4bc659a812c27835f683b3f3f7d7391209f3b7d3\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1786815582 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786815582 +0700\n\nfeat(TASKBOLT-6a6d9eb9336b22c68a3c8315): manual Complete Sprint action (#54)\n\n* feat(TASKBOLT-6a6d9eb9336b22c68a3c8315): manual Complete Sprint button\n\nFrontend-only slice of the \"Complete Sprint\" story. Backend already\nsupports it — PATCH /sprints/:id accepts status via UpdateSprintDto and\nis already admin-gated via assertCanManageSprint — so this needed no\nAPI changes, just a button.\n\nShown on Active Sprint when the caller is a project admin\n(useProjectRole, same composable already used to gate sprint edit/\ndelete in SprintManagement/ProjectDetailPage) and either today is on\nor past the sprint''s endDate, or every task in the sprint is DONE or\nCLOSED (obsoleted tasks don''t block completion, consistent with how\nthey''re already excluded from the points total on this page).\n\nClicking confirms via window.confirm (matching the existing delete-\nconfirmation pattern elsewhere in this repo), calls the existing\nupdateSprint() service function with status: COMPLETED, and reloads —\nthe sprint no longer matches the ACTIVE filter so the page naturally\nfalls back to its existing \"no active sprint\" state.\n\nAuto-completing a sprint when its endDate passes (the backend cron\nhalf of the original AC) is out of scope here — tracked separately as\ntech debt.\n\n* feat(TASKBOLT-6a6d9eb9336b22c68a3c8315): mark-as-done button in SprintManagement\n\nSame \"Complete Sprint\" story, extended to the Configure page''s sprint\nlist — an admin can now mark an active sprint as done from there too,\nnot just from the Active Sprint board.\n\nShown per-row when the sprint is ACTIVE and its endDate is today or in\nthe past. Unlike the Active Sprint page''s button, there''s no \"all\ntasks done\" condition here — this list only fetches sprints, not their\ntasks, so that signal isn''t available (and wasn''t asked for here; the\ntask said \"today as equal as after sprint date\").\n\nEdit/Delete stay disabled for an active sprint exactly as before\n(activeSprintLocked) — marking as done is a distinct, deliberate\naction, not a general edit, so it''s not gated by that same lock.\n\nReuses the existing updateSprint() call and window.confirm() pattern\nalready used by confirmDelete() in this same file, and the\ntoast.sprintCompleted/sprintCompleteFailed keys added in the previous\ncommit for the Active Sprint page''s version of this button.\n\nUpdated tests/components/SprintManagement.test.ts: the existing\n\"disables edit/delete for an active sprint\" test asserted all buttons\nin the row were disabled, which broke once a 3rd (enabled) button\ncould appear — narrowed that assertion to the two locked buttons\nspecifically, and added 3 new tests covering the mark-as-done button''s\nvisibility across active/inactive and past/future-endDate combinations.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgKReCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiD0QAKXJVDK8ukL7aw2uSdfaIxLP\nUNBCkqLWar/4PF+AfBazZ8VsS5d2VWBIoTfhRJdB6/uH3FOYXjdaRhkcAgRnjxCy\nhbyknPSSlmJ44NtcAy2YdM+UbPlY8rPhbHwbAuszONw9roDuMNdgzL5jGXaeJZPR\njmSV3Ua678BjRk9swfF4E+k4joEtTnIhQVec0EPW7Tzw3vC95AoHjtnHQVIc0BPF\nxW0Nw2df1DmHz3OjGOR/4I3qaiF5ddDQTX/XPcGoHgcI9LDnOfRhRpVr/wWnulLR\nB26CcSCWTmG/UVX4NXkHg4VXEFyhzqvT7c3Q8PKz1Q+Bze4eeuGby3kaOg+sS57v\noaG4iA2gDPpiJh2DwhXFEyViH0ZQcOLpC9ooKTx/RuPOYT0eJAhN1f3vj09XvgA0\nro3xMMz6ErVF/+uWunKtDL4wjTM3z1G6H2bhKl8dIkfH1DR/ATkzuPIi88xINZwz