edfe0dd73388569afb7aa53647645b84a5818"}],"sha":"e0b7039edea15ebdca38591fbccbb2abf4dc87e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/e0b7039edea15ebdca38591fbccbb2abf4dc87e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68178042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/1bcedfe0dd73388569afb7aa53647645b84a5818/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T16:06:55Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T16:06:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(TASKBOLT-6a6b45b472bd072be7e1b59e): fix responsive layout issues on Active Sprint and Backlogs (#50)\n\nActive Sprint: the kanban board''s 3 columns used flex-1 min-w-0, which\nsqueezed each column to ~106px on a 375px-wide viewport with no way to\nscroll and see clipped content (text/badges truncated, no horizontal\nscrollbar). Give columns a fixed min width (w-72) and make the row\nhorizontally scrollable below the md breakpoint, reverting to the\noriginal equal-width flex-1 layout on desktop.\n\nBacklogs: the header''s right-hand button group (show-closed checkbox,\nFilters, New Issue) didn''t wrap, so New Issue clipped ~3px off the right\nedge on a 375px viewport. Let that group wrap like the search input\ngroup already does.\n\nSwapped the Active Sprint tests'' brittle Tailwind-class CSS selector\n(which also incidentally matched an unrelated div, requiring an index\noffset) for a stable data-testid on the column element.\n\nAudited Home, Backlogs, Reports, Configure, and the task detail drawer\nat mobile/tablet widths — no other issues found.","tree":{"sha":"616a09a7eb2c895e3ebb729251c4226c14f48b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/616a09a7eb2c895e3ebb729251c4226c14f48b28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/1bcedfe0dd73388569afb7aa53647645b84a5818","verification":{"payload":"tree 616a09a7eb2c895e3ebb729251c4226c14f48b28\nparent 6f81bd807322d66528f7cce6af8bfc297f7dc3a0\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785514015 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785514015 +0700\n\nfix(TASKBOLT-6a6b45b472bd072be7e1b59e): fix responsive layout issues on Active Sprint and Backlogs (#50)\n\nActive Sprint: the kanban board''s 3 columns used flex-1 min-w-0, which\nsqueezed each column to ~106px on a 375px-wide viewport with no way to\nscroll and see clipped content (text/badges truncated, no horizontal\nscrollbar). Give columns a fixed min width (w-72) and make the row\nhorizontally scrollable below the md breakpoint, reverting to the\noriginal equal-width flex-1 layout on desktop.\n\nBacklogs: the header''s right-hand button group (show-closed checkbox,\nFilters, New Issue) didn''t wrap, so New Issue clipped ~3px off the right\nedge on a 375px viewport. Let that group wrap like the search input\ngroup already does.\n\nSwapped the Active Sprint tests'' brittle Tailwind-class CSS selector\n(which also incidentally matched an unrelated div, requiring an index\noffset) for a stable data-testid on the column element.\n\nAudited Home, Backlogs, Reports, Configure, and the task detail drawer\nat mobile/tablet widths — no other issues found.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbMgfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+NAQAIoKWepYCyl46x7Iomnrg6CV\nrrq+1SLHLP5Tx/2LX+xRy97cotdWMS4hz3kFLaeyDBzeAIn2jBk56R7sVwAopagk\nsYyU7FXJkGTJRQE+PE6AuqYPHDsfK4TVU53sblNV1R13sTDyPHkse/9xXKDkKOL1\nOcEmv1pGp8FsyDk8I00rXCVnEZ0lywayc6J4yEMV2wHIw5TRkkL7Q7XzOPWVsIUN\nPRbqozTJXg0UrK8mSqlypSbTes6schjLvUnKAobw9sa1SNX1ISxXp8SIlv5p2C7e\nQtB2+6lvBgAIzrjlzLUmOXJ8NlGcRTl2oJoYfdtCL19Ush312jsgzS7Lpg8vi6IZ\nFa0l3F28GB8kfH5ZFHRzVUkQY98JI6jyQ6H6Lqgug9aDE8mZZkKBrVF7Kle3OEwD\nXMazSIOBHz9jqvxgtkhPMcraJvqHOOZPrbjal/Pmm07XbQj0TIGF7kR9yfmaHAAJ\nvaTwiXoR0EZVEp0x2v0addhvpunUqBXLmmP/ElBMz5IoGBjwRHWG2hYMhX1SOLH9\nRaOTIdL+GQnSblc+Xh7FSJLuAP4ya0JPK9ME2MJJu46vYm6g+nKz8OgOunMnttuW\nJx4de1siKt9MK+h5sJF+wZZ+qMutzWmDcE4pZtSIGQVAC9DSDBr3jJ/tlMzpF7xa\nrfEGJ3XV+V3xYTfDCLyX\n=MCqw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-31T16:06:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_t