/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/4d3e532a3383cb9fe3e36259399acc0905f27e8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T15:53:29Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T15:53:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(TASKBOLT-6a5f48378d64db6217579edd): keep task menu anchored during drawer animation (#45)\n\nInvestigation: the task detail \"⋮\" menu (the only ellipsis-menu in the app)\nis a reka-ui DropdownMenu whose trigger sits in the Drawer header. The\nDrawer slides in via a CSS transform over ~200-300ms. Reka-ui''s default\n`updatePositionStrategy: ''optimized''` only repositions the floating menu on\nresize/scroll events, neither of which fires for a pure CSS-transform\nanimation, so if the menu is opened while the drawer is still sliding in\nits position gets fixed once and doesn''t track the trigger for the rest of\nthe transition, leaving it visually detached once the animation settles.\n\nFix: set `updatePositionStrategy: ''always''` (re-measures every animation\nframe while open) as the default for the shared DropdownMenuContent\nwrapper, so this applies to every dropdown menu in the app, not just this\none.","tree":{"sha":"cbfd3a2415b7a2bb460a271b373273adeece0c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/cbfd3a2415b7a2bb460a271b373273adeece0c92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/4d3e532a3383cb9fe3e36259399acc0905f27e8b","verification":{"payload":"tree cbfd3a2415b7a2bb460a271b373273adeece0c92\nparent 321a720e2c4130e7f01d3546f06731e42b4e2b3e\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785513209 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785513209 +0700\n\nfix(TASKBOLT-6a5f48378d64db6217579edd): keep task menu anchored during drawer animation (#45)\n\nInvestigation: the task detail \"⋮\" menu (the only ellipsis-menu in the app)\nis a reka-ui DropdownMenu whose trigger sits in the Drawer header. The\nDrawer slides in via a CSS transform over ~200-300ms. Reka-ui''s default\n`updatePositionStrategy: ''optimized''` only repositions the floating menu on\nresize/scroll events, neither of which fires for a pure CSS-transform\nanimation, so if the menu is opened while the drawer is still sliding in\nits position gets fixed once and doesn''t track the trigger for the rest of\nthe transition, leaving it visually detached once the animation settles.\n\nFix: set `updatePositionStrategy: ''always''` (re-measures every animation\nframe while open) as the default for the shared DropdownMenuContent\nwrapper, so this applies to every dropdown menu in the app, not just this\none.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbMT5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABfUQAGeTPr8fza8dODuN8JE2fTtQ\n5JD61GLURiHkqRo6fs/HsZIgkKte269KYKuVJH5YAe60pqguevaI1w8X1oCSGpqZ\nlYkQ/A7CSVnl3HFmV5E7FevTKOnPE594a0KDWMmCJpjICsberRqatGokHYgQQyjU\nNQd7N6BMAwUSzKhEF3CNzklEVF0nh6VXMT1BtXqBQ6w4AW9of5p+Rsis351s067O\n2Mmimr/YP56lhetnSCcYab+2ZAE58OwiBROdTPdG8Nc+9Qb1Oa0cEFxbnevdKqEb\nlG4vRhlksDf4/ykxXCRPhzKEQL0JqrQJcYn97MuNrenmPBFddMMOFuhQgTGq6sCm\nLpHIeFnSMrvosqQ8Sz4u8mxC8LQciFv+4eYNfg139Ie2Vebvzpn+TWRiuARzIH6U\nN1l6tgvJt1koz0Oe3G46wiPAZbKb+XzjbYIfk8A/p9xHT+iiYC0SHMEycS8FA8J5\nZrHCbmstgAPhH+BBuk+r2ZtBTv5w6rpShEUKSRdP2jO4ex7LF5tKkdILYdam8sdX\nkFInyWmvk/28VphTZ