":"2026-07-31T15:47:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(TASKBOLT-6a6a2e258beade0b08934b1f): keep backlog sprint groups always open (#43)\n\nBacklog sprint rows were collapsible, letting a group hide tasks with no\nway to see them without an explicit toggle. Remove the collapse toggle and\nopen/close state so every sprint row (including the unscheduled bucket)\nalways renders its tasks.","tree":{"sha":"f84fc939f858d98c71eff40ef42d0723bd410a0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/f84fc939f858d98c71eff40ef42d0723bd410a0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/ed9adaf22355c71036315f1467c27851bb44b992","verification":{"payload":"tree f84fc939f858d98c71eff40ef42d0723bd410a0a\nparent 56a4872c84109f19610d91a085e865bedb170b84\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785512870 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785512870 +0700\n\nfix(TASKBOLT-6a6a2e258beade0b08934b1f): keep backlog sprint groups always open (#43)\n\nBacklog sprint rows were collapsible, letting a group hide tasks with no\nway to see them without an explicit toggle. Remove the collapse toggle and\nopen/close state so every sprint row (including the unscheduled bucket)\nalways renders its tasks.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbMOmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAylMQAE3+j+rpyXSgEIv9fsTunfX2\na3AgBTdj2mUQSbYfMOCAetQH1xmCMVMYxoFaQsWXyG0wIapyj/3QcPtxv3jvo3Gd\nJk9tUHn88jIVFR2mZUyMY622ocecz5pdQfQ6Hn0s7TBNUVGVFBsamcxCgmkIqrTX\nHPYihsJlD9JebXe9isbV5ekvVYoXqHu5OaDBSO82Jc/VZz9B3s3WCrgcEFVqI4lO\nrz7JGS3lJlFA8w+vszqP9j4K3QoAQUEXAapfOqhUn1aFjiPfS/lP75Vsl7jrciUP\nueMAL61Pdx9Kv3jtgtUZQQLxDsVEXNvSiHYP/vuZJFsszOhXOT0+NcI7w4WyuVdC\nWdn8zzmTvx5fwSPhdAa8eILHSAIFFFR7DTjtqKFMt7k+da0dOHgty9Miae9o/7Jq\nsGStXtxfVlBo9kiseJZcX1DZVpQ/awAnIaQMX2nd45ElO/lGpc0bkONk660/hhYJ\nAGJ21N2SYQpDYZmRfH05CGntPw0fIKw1FMCBWKZr+Wjq+NN+uTtyMcy/QcuI7dFS\nQ6+Bt9OsKMZPLBFj7FHRtAFedn+i6XOmD5UzNJnV+FcyVdn86GzBFW0E33z/UbMz\nLW3