github.com/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commit/207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762","sha":"207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762"}],"sha":"5a42e825dbb25587872efa4e9f406c0578cbfc9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/5a42e825dbb25587872efa4e9f406c0578cbfc9c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68178042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:32:45Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:32:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add delete task option to task detail menu (#40)\n\nAdds \"Delete task\" to the ellipsis menu in the task detail drawer/page,\ngated behind a native confirm() (same pattern already used for comment\ndeletion) so an accidental click can''t destroy a task.\n\n- task.service.ts: deleteTask (DELETE /tasks/:id)\n- useProjectTasks: deleteTask wrapper (apiClient guard, no auto-refetch —\n  same design as createTask/updateTask; callers refresh or navigate away\n  themselves)\n- TaskDetailHeader: menu item + separator, emits \"delete\"\n- TaskDetailContent: confirms via window.confirm, emits \"delete\" with\n  the task id up to the parent\n- TaskDetail (drawer): passes the event through\n- Wired in all three consumers: BacklogsPage/ActiveSprintPage close the\n  drawer and refresh the list; TaskDetailPage (a dedicated page with\n  nothing left to show once its task is gone) navigates back to the\n  backlog instead","tree":{"sha":"e40fa40c131baea64f491f935dc848579275655a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/e40fa40c131baea64f491f935dc848579275655a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762","verification":{"payload":"tree e40fa40c131baea64f491f935dc848579275655a\nparent 892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785339165 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785339165 +0700\n\nAdd delete task option to task detail menu (#40)\n\nAdds \"Delete task\" to the ellipsis menu in the task detail drawer/page,\ngated behind a native confirm() (same pattern already used for comment\ndeletion) so an accidental click can''t destroy a task.\n\n- task.service.ts: deleteTask (DELETE /tasks/:id)\n- useProjectTasks: deleteTask wrapper (apiClient guard, no auto-refetch —\n  same design as createTask/updateTask; callers refresh or navigate away\n  themselves)\n- TaskDetailHeader: menu item + separator, emits \"delete\"\n- TaskDetailContent: confirms via window.confirm, emits \"delete\" with\n  the task id up to the parent\n- TaskDetail (drawer): passes the event through\n- Wired in all three consumers: BacklogsPage/ActiveSprintPage close the\n  drawer and refresh the list; TaskDetailPage (a dedicated page with\n  nothing left to show once its task is gone) navigates back to the\n  backlog instead","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqah0dCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFv8QAIfeWiHBnpwzC75RvOv+actW\na9Aix/i8HCuLyE6c9zuDUwP4PIy3CaVa1yF4EjE7XHsB76Zt5cZTpgUH+iH8p8xx\npi6n/o3aTILxvb4+Rzu2gKpXtUGDRLp8VDGRsdpj7vhFNI8eFV6ggJljtETF35jg\nxPBL0xSNuxDLdH1wZ71/66EFwPqd5j5lXl0sbkcLFKr6Do6gKt60BqHtNVTjYptv\nGBsOsohkPzpCNZ0jpMM4m4MGZR0QpPyKD/9Db+gdkeiFqp9ES5LfXfSKtSa8m9De\nHNWlIIMWQe8yjqbObQEyzyu6b/l6eD0Y64iuZ6ABgK9YdTpFN/PdLjhwtkvWbeS5\nYzoTNFFfFPxrT9RymdDyI3X4vNppIRyM58zqSEEAknm14TSUWaskRePgQFJT03lv\nBCShqtLDTEBbyJr3O0siQG05w+hJrmmb6yKMhD4Q0o3Saf55ybJi1EdjLWzVGUot\nlHpO1drE7rpeuC03iJd9qpQKNRgJAPOGcEhcsN2CXEuYV/PIOQZWGytpWBrNCRmB\nwho757ZZruDOHEn4AyhApQXYB2gujck98Ubomo5hc8rP5AMHy5I/ikyYBmDk5HVy\ne1Fq96iWl4og7R0+kBjmkNic8RBF52nfF6bDSe7UOS6P1TomMFMT+N7yrJoKGgqb\nMgn3dza9eWlSi3UjOR0K\n=L8Mt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T15:32:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commit/207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762","node_id":"C_kwDOQNwaddoAKDIwN2Q3MDMyNjBlZjFjM2Q2YzBjZjBmYmI4MjNiNDE2NWY1NmI3NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commit/892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253","sha":"892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253"}],"sha":"207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/207d703260ef1c3d6c0cf0fbb823b4165f56b762"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68178042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:37:56Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:40:22Z","email":"lmjcvm@lmjcvm.local","name":"huy_nguyen"},"message":"Unify task read/write orchestration into useProjectTasks composable (#39)\n\nBacklog, Task Detail, and Active Sprint each re-implemented task\nfetch/create/update differently: raw apiClient guards duplicated three\ntimes, Active Sprint''s own task-fetch had no request-race protection\n(unlike Backlog/Task Detail via useBacklogTasks), and each page repeated\nthe same \"check apiClient, call service, toast, refresh\" shape with\nsmall inconsistencies.\n\nRenamed useBacklogTasks -> useProjectTasks and generalized it:\n- Added an optional `sprintId` filter so Active Sprint can scope fetches\n  to its resolved sprint instead of the whole project; the composable\n  clears the list rather than fetching unscoped tasks while no sprint\n  has resolved yet.\n- Added createTask/updateTask methods (apiClient guard + service call).\n  Deliberately does NOT auto-refetch on success — Backlog/Task Detail\n  call fetchTasks() themselves for a full refresh, while Active Sprint''s\n  drag-drop applies the result as a targeted optimistic update instead,\n  preserving the array-mutation optimization from the drag-drop ticket\n  rather than forcing every move through a full-list round-trip.\n\nActive Sprint keeps its own active-sprint-resolution logic (finding\nwhich sprint is active is genuinely different from listing/filtering\nproject tasks) and its own direct members fetch, composing them with\nthe shared composable rather than being absorbed into it wholesale.\n\nAdded tests for sprintId scoping and create/update orchestration in\nuseProjectTasks.test.ts, and drag-and-drop optimistic-update + rollback\ntests in ActiveSprintPage.test.ts (previously untested).","tree":{"sha":"59a879d386c61ee0a22d85ebb273dbd6ba23b287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/59a879d386c61ee0a22d85ebb273dbd6ba23b287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commit/892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253","node_id":"C_kwDOQNwaddoAKDg5MjQ0NWM3YTAyNTAyZWM0NmE2NTI4NjBmMzQxMTE1YjcwMzEyNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commit/04da578c620b08adfe0828596a4e5c979938c0c7","sha":"04da578c620b08adfe0828596a4e5c979938c0c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/04da578c620b08adfe0828596a4e5c979938c0c7"}],"sha":"892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/892445c7a02502ec46a652860f341115b7031253"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68178042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/04da578c620b08adfe0828596a4e5c979938c0c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:34:39Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:34:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Move shared task drawer/form components out of the backlogs feature (#38)\n\nActiveSprintPage imported TaskForm/TaskDetail from @/features/backlogs,\na sibling feature, purely because that''s where they happened to live —\nneither component has any backlog-specific logic. Relocated TaskForm,\nTaskFormFields, TaskDetail, TaskDetailContent, and TaskDetailHeader to\nshared/domain-ui/task/ so Active Sprint and Backlogs both depend on a\nshared module instead of one feature reaching into another''s folder.\n\nThe backlogs feature barrel (index.ts) only ever re-exported these two\ncomponents for that one cross-feature import, so it''s removed rather\nthan left empty.","tree":{"sha":"c7528c2db349574039a79a3540493c0d323e4c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/c7528c2db349574039a79a3540493c0d323e4c05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/04da578c620b08adfe0828596a4e5c979938c0c7","verification":{"payload":"tree c7528c2db349574039a79a3540493c0d323e4c05\nparent 846f9b5d0b2ee1bd074ae3e8ee4fa570ec6e54fa\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785335679 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785335679 +0700\n\nMove shared task drawer/form components out of the backlogs feature (#38)\n\nActiveSprintPage imported TaskForm/TaskDetail from @/features/backlogs,\na sibling feature, purely because that''s where they happened to live —\nneither component has any backlog-specific logic. Relocated TaskForm,\nTaskFormFields, TaskDetail, TaskDetailContent, and TaskDetailHeader to\nshared/domain-ui/task/ so Active Sprint and Backlogs both depend on a\nshared module instead of one feature reaching into another''s folder.\n\nThe backlogs feature barrel (index.ts) only ever re-exported these two\ncomponents for that one cross-feature import, so it''s removed rather\nthan left empty.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqag9/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeoQQADDY2WvpQ6VmW7GNYmoB4OJu\nrCjZASjjeKN+XwqQ+m3gQh1HQIOkNp5p3EQVvsD/4bKmlkoTZgqLHpP8nEyPUtBK\nUlGyY+nVlJZO6VQpoJKSRbpBGsasX6XrHL4Ki+swYsJcFzCLqcfg86KdXIneIIpp\ndAju1TO/+onpTtNXdPy9Ch/g1RCCu9rLv6eAzBPU9UfTQjWuSu/8OgIkfM96