rees/84a66bf971b2d6106abfeb1c8250bc69ec049464"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/846f9b5d0b2ee1bd074ae3e8ee4fa570ec6e54fa","verification":{"payload":"tree 84a66bf971b2d6106abfeb1c8250bc69ec049464\nparent 22a354d7eb69751c0519325d5de6097db9177bfe\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785335519 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785335519 +0700\n\nMove board column and sprint-order config out of page logic (#37)\n\nActiveSprintPage owned the kanban column definitions (identity, order,\nstyling) and the CLOSED-into-DONE folding rule as page-local constants;\nBacklogsPage owned its own sprint-status sort order the same way. Moved\nboth into shared/lib (board-columns.ts, sprint-display.ts) so they''re\nreusable and reconfigurable from one place instead of hardcoded per page.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqag7fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAos8QAJAQ5ijnHWqUeeOfR3Bs0TxM\nOjUdAp3/8TriqayMir5u7FsLufqsPzgwODTbFhyH+pkjtoyPqamtoYjdAPyfKjme\noifNEBofYOhexu6gvhM2VZthRjRfd2i04UYIAp/wLqeBzQSae/g2V4hyAyBd3Wpi\nmBoOKtqhwDnm2i7olEqkj2IT+t5RuRmU+BcWSHz/N3ciIl5Rv83bDCjVPFh1EvYA\nbKdiao3d5IqL4KTM+i4JBS+nkkLPxMk9Q34Ozoxzc+WKgDIYrXwvLJyx/vbjvZa1\no3/nnRq+vVHIrOSMB71J8i0TLmaLIVep++/lRsE0XvxFgCCAA8Bhwa+lJBRCsSIO\nqdpCbuillzhYtPSset6XLf9U1ONDL3/qPnaODbjEB3LSTKb5yFErSK/neb7gBtKj\nwxx9kvBT2BScGIP7KmJpLYHUAy/cl9dBPbV2U6BnDwx9ZnZTC/rSpyl1Bd03A0Hp\n6okY7/Gd1Doxywh6C25oUNbrCPG7aFOuMrZJH4ozzfV7k2yV3DjBRc25ESFesMhy\nNz7IVgyXUOsRdRTDO0f+8iWFW+ng1QVIG2rS2dqgWjaIZjJnaekYYKSYu0IYovhS\nc16hY7muXEzXY/V9DabOQQLwH2+02Sx+8ysqom9tyyHmU21wmUTgvsYqP66GnN/f\nt7GXWiAOVRPRfBjdUHr5\n=f2qK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T14:32:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/w