ser had no signal anything went wrong. Expose membersError/sprintsError\n(resolved independently via allSettled so one failing doesn''t hide the\nother''s success) and surface them as toasts in both consumers.","tree":{"sha":"87c1c507b74873c2500d877f725dd87c4d00d971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/87c1c507b74873c2500d877f725dd87c4d00d971"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/e41d93d2b7afd38d75c1371476a27f51f40ec80d","verification":{"payload":"tree 87c1c507b74873c2500d877f725dd87c4d00d971\nparent c5c17787ef2e2044df06295e7c50a91d7da3b095\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785333966 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785333966 +0700\n\nSurface members/sprints fetch failures instead of a silent console.error (#32)\n\nuseBacklogTasks swallowed member/sprint load errors with only a\nconsole.error, so a failure looked identical to an empty result and the\nuser had no signal anything went wrong. Expose membersError/sprintsError\n(resolved independently via allSettled so one failing doesn''t hide the\nother''s success) and surface them as toasts in both consumers.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqagjOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFMgQAJ9co1ib941v+Ndt+27QBWQM\n4PTrzIYolK6GtGrw/rtf+WUv0rCO5kcddAB8IwYSK9lZXxcjZ0IlgVTvuZcScYCf\nhoe93IgzlWX/JN3zmbMKXL7L7SPXokt6zrpDKVkz1JeBu4+qYWiUd+jyMU/ruOeD\nDtKbbZFzLsVXx4CpZVcDF+pJpu6+CZmHLKD8JDzN0mj2SEkJz2yETkTiO8QCwN6+\n8zbktWQ1jVcX+H59rpdTrxw9aNjDsG4tVWPq6nXl2rXm25+mcZ5EJ5Q4eniaeFWj\n91Rn3jLC/hU5ibqpJ+bM6aSreVxxWE90NHjnEMSebYAQBlZ4eIJ2KvN39c9PI+RR\nh4VFFLPMjbI6CIv7jlQdQSp4o/BZztW87o+JJ0BhktURJN6A3FClNj6/g2MAkXjC\nXr0uWNMJr0dv5TkgD9jzWf/jcfnjAkta88sTTkQSaY3eDiAVq52GUeFLGf/dv12f\n/Pf2HS+Lk3sAe5pPIZqI3g6HjioWAM1woDe+Qg3F8S9I2/lIGk3EU6a9FVZlil4k\nr46T2vp8vlW87niiwKkJ2DmeRl/4HG8v0yjMWEunwQiVkWmDZVrxDG4AsxeBoCxF\ndxrodIct/zqYvqYaz7eEDj5O98sUUxOyHc6WDd4AFMiUJ8qHSdEDSUNfrf4ujLyh\njzd+bwvpD4e1aY+clZJX\n=gDAQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-