n\nDeep-link task selection only ran in onMounted, so following a second\n/tasks/:taskId link into an already-mounted BacklogsPage silently did\nnothing — the drawer stayed on whatever task was already selected.\nWatching route.query.task covers in-page navigation the same way the\ninitial mount does.","tree":{"sha":"92cea93b641c065fc9bb4f9c1987a20025fbb73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/92cea93b641c065fc9bb4f9c1987a20025fbb73f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/beb5f2744da45b3df7d74826ed5767682c4c2382","verification":{"payload":"tree 92cea93b641c065fc9bb4f9c1987a20025fbb73f\nparent bdffc6eda642dab48e7f3de8b79c596bbb0e0057\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785253532 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785253532 +0700\n\nRe-open backlog deep-link target when the ?task= query changes (#30)\n\nDeep-link task selection only ran in onMounted, so following a second\n/tasks/:taskId link into an already-mounted BacklogsPage silently did\nnothing — the drawer stayed on whatever task was already selected.\nWatching route.query.task covers in-page navigation the same way the\ninitial mount does.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaM6dCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZMQQAHDVkV362rjLPGpMJ7e/cWdf\n+Z8RHz8YJLwHKkl/mYLWTdVKrKCnspDoj1TiN2MI9tPGhUisnJ6+s+Ek9SAY3PMK\nfv07HuhZZtJFYPuTJcwj1kiYg7G9ZWY7xBnoTGDjhaBDDCFkHjQNug0EjItMO46e\nc36e2hXwM1PDKWkEJLY3+N3cjriZ7vN+N95Ih5wuhXvp/VtttJ6OQVJD6CIqtB1Q\n42IXvSWH4Uout/QBN3L0xFLW5wpy4vhvVHKJDNFjVMyhlCjHbnhbuz8ECGux4pVm\nJsdGmkthqYXjPCtYUw7xMS6Z8TiVP+ZCNOCKcXfv0JwloB/Ov4M6GZagU+wckLOT\nSPK57UayI8j7p2FiMwuUx3Sd3yUhzT01S49XU7B2sS6+WGqqDzGKSYytAGrU8SAq\n/KbTw/CNRod2T4AV6OKVU6MXTm3h0mtACNfTE7cHgwuk7bFoZRyx6wL/yJzNCTtD\nF6yLghYJQWAnA2ekZbQ6DHzwXCoD5qgXfabEUZRQ91ZLni+/4z8mpv+uEwApJZIF\nnUwNP9xCu53HDZwGtBtZCzImhm6nfeF6v0MnSviOcJfIK5UDC4CoYu408t+6eXTW\nkVUlQZEU3GEGqoorTY2LEEQt2vPUKPE8EKVlO//Ji00cftKpZWR+dkypgc2WAStg\n6WutleMr2FvM3r6y9q