mail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add createTask to task service and migrate component create flows (#26)\n\nTask creation was inlined as raw apiClient POST calls in three separate\ncomponents, duplicating request wiring and error handling that already\nexist for update. Adding createTask mirrors the existing service pattern\n(createProject, createSprint) and gives future task-write consumers one\nplace to change.","tree":{"sha":"bbfacceff88aee1315409390335377176636abd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/bbfacceff88aee1315409390335377176636abd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/1181df41cf4e1190978b5eb130ff76760ab7c983","verification":{"payload":"tree bbfacceff88aee1315409390335377176636abd1\nparent 28e97388fddeb882b24bd6bae1b9549c58951368\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785252216 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785252216 +0700\n\nAdd createTask to task service and migrate component create flows (#26)\n\nTask creation was inlined as raw apiClient POST calls in three separate\ncomponents, duplicating request wiring and error handling that already\nexist for update. Adding createTask mirrors the existing service pattern\n(createProject, createSprint) and gives future task-write consumers one\nplace to change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaMl4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAon4QACNnPh/DTcJZsdbjDEBypRbO\nxlq0L5h80dxIkhE8x4rsG1KQcYx08ANwPiSrUKjlOjqg9sMhUOqz8hbbZ9dNSkKU\nqxhXgVqs33TAtYmKV4biZVBIcAFfJzPVY5UZqxWDS1T97W47Z9+Oil7PsQ2VaQhM\n+LVqYL6kUhaDfJ/3WwDSfnXYY0/JcikccW8PJkHjg6k+GpDv8TogmdykuJ3/AZQQ\nT2K4V4TxUB4IwYDdDhZmlohAsulN07qyijxrjjq97zVVG3d+ge2bmPP5PfWpMwIx\nGSInRNDYLNUKtV1GDDI/245SJ2zK5pcU2rd2vg28tEJnm3R+Jq26ldCY18aiYq8R\npAMnugM+mkeswzjW+iGOiMIPCJzSGqk1RmrdHvnbbAAUe5QuAr5G0W8n/hd405z+\nb1t2omspf+pfNqTQA5Kmvepp1MmxD216quR6n/JbFN3JJigvPYS/cWzpVkDxFxB8\niIplSg+yPFMjZ8BENiDpxMccfL05yGnD2O1kgIktkKUTdAqOlm/I5ekaQanlttuE\neh