.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/1dd9697841661d0b9b8a2e32e9105a361e4c6e1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T08:35:48Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T08:35:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add dedicated task detail page (#23)\n\n* refactor(backlogs): extract TaskDetailContent from the drawer shell\n\nTaskDetail.vue hardwired the task-detail view inside a Drawer. Pull the\nheader/content/dialogs into TaskDetailContent so it can be reused\noutside a drawer too (needed for the upcoming dedicated task page).\nTaskDetail.vue is now a thin Drawer wrapper around it.\n\nAlso swap TaskDetailHeader''s DrawerTitle (Reka UI''s DialogTitle, which\nthrows when rendered outside a Dialog/Drawer root) for a plain heading,\nsince the header now needs to render in non-drawer contexts too.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5\n\n* refactor(backlogs): extract useBacklogTasks composable\n\nMove BacklogsPage''s task/member/sprint fetching into a shared\ncomposable so the upcoming dedicated task page can reuse the exact\nsame data-loading logic instead of duplicating it.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5\n\n* feat(backlogs): add dedicated task detail page route\n\nNew route backlogs/:taskId (task-detail) renders TaskDetailContent as\na full page instead of a drawer, resolving to\ndashboard/taskbolt/[projectId]/backlogs/[taskId] in the shell. This is\npurely additive — backlogs?task=<id> keeps opening the existing drawer\nfor quick access from the list.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5\n\n* feat(backlogs): copy ticket number and dedicated page link separately\n\nTaskDetailHeader''s existing click-to-copy on the task id now copies\nthe ticket number only, instead of a deep link. Add a separate button\n(lucide Link icon) that copies the full URL to the task''s new\ndedicated detail page.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5","tree":{"sha":"6d142ac755bf13e6c3e8fa2f9450ed37dabef418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/6d142ac755bf13e6c3e8fa2f9450ed37dabef418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/1dd9697841661d0b9b8a2e32e9105a361e4c6e1e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d142ac755bf13e6c3e8fa2f9450ed37dabef418\nparent 69f5afb5fb21afbe58d9a533f212fefb1f74ce85\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785054948 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785054948 +0700\n\nAdd dedicated task detail page (#23)\n\n* refactor(backlogs): extract TaskDetailContent from the drawer shell\n\nTaskDetail.vue hardwired the task-detail view inside a Drawer. Pull the\nheader/content/dialogs into TaskDetailContent so it can be reused\noutside a drawer too (needed for the upcoming dedicated task page).\nTaskDetail.vue is now a thin Drawer wrapper around it.\n\nAlso swap TaskDetailHeader''s DrawerTitle (Reka UI''s DialogTitle, which\nthrows when rendered outside a Dialog/Drawer root) for a plain heading,\nsince the header now needs to render in non-drawer contexts too.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5\n\n* refactor(backlogs): extract useBacklogTasks composable\n\nMove BacklogsPage''s task/member/sprint fetching into a shared\ncomposable so the upcoming dedicated task page can reuse the exact\nsame data-loading logic instead of duplicating it.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5\n\n* feat(backlogs): add dedicated task detail page route\n\nNew route backlogs/:taskId (task-detail) renders TaskDetailContent as\na full page instead of a drawer, resolving to\ndashboard/taskbolt/[projectId]/backlogs/[taskId] in the shell. This is\npurely additive — backlogs?task=<id> keeps opening the existing drawer\nfor quick access from the list.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5\n\n* feat(backlogs): copy ticket number and dedicated page link separately\n\nTaskDetailHeader''s existing click-to-copy on the task id now copies\nthe ticket number only, instead of a deep link. Add a separate button\n(lucide Link icon) that copies the full URL to the task''s new\ndedicated detail page.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a65000127ec988310fa8fd5","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZcbkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk24QABZ7dlG+9r75fJmBrPs5mueV\nontt4INH9BbSUpQxr+QeyaF+OU8jmds7nQgxC3GgzS+SOGk5XRukM2roE4xUVomX\nra1Qhzac8ihYkKfe9LI0cf4EayTFu0zdyOXliKqb9PHgTy+adm/qIcbsu50GIND7\nxeH944/2PjMIhaf4jmfZy+6r+0bJGgSSZvCR1gr2tEsjLyhXuCCHUIeLGNJM0Pb9\nqr2bTqrUgdVZxnl+ocZH/pOXesxiJDRBlK4taxxEroXPc1iqIKCJxu1F/AMvgcBa\nFkcB8dCiyk+icYWWHiqJWcRW+OtUrm/ULkFcWDkOzXq428+LgXvG51oprl5d8M1J\n6GBwasK7uQPA/g3RMxm2z6RX9InZpcyqDjH6wZUq14lB3cvxnY6jI2XzI7zkS3sy\nM3Le4l8GdKMs9p9Ir/PsjMhIppKqLkEEaOYJX/MGgpeNrwAzaf98q1pA6xM71Bf3\n1MdGe5QwamWM8yJ5fY2EWOixL/bcMS4FXGeyo1O284gz9fcznrC82lLpgPhyycmo\nuIrzhXa5oQRBdcc3bxfhDJSwVmC9Id5NkCBUdj5kD7h80ja58pZRR3lYnd8pe8ly\nTWBkOxy72knMSItAyzvTT5bfuHT51uZUfMqsnDganI2M3Yf1GFh/706xaPxyoPrh\n8uyNBVKLNozUKrqaALhm\n=gv5T\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T08:35:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"ht