askbolt/commits/69f5afb5fb21afbe58d9a533f212fefb1f74ce85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:50:50Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:50:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Backlogs: group tasks into sprint rows (#22)\n\n* feat(backlogs): group backlog tasks by sprint into rows\n\nAdd BacklogSprintRow and a sprintGroups computed in BacklogsPage that\nbuckets parent tasks by sprintId, so each fetched sprint renders as its\nown row instead of a single flat task list.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522bd8afd1debb24aa021\n\n* feat(backlogs): give the no-sprint bucket a dedicated Backlog row\n\nStyle the sprintId===null row distinctly (dashed separator, muted\nitalic label) and show an explicit empty state so it always reads as\na dedicated bucket rather than just another sprint.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522be8afd1debb24aa022\n\n* feat(backlogs): add collapsible sprint row headers with goal/dates/status\n\nEach sprint row now shows a header with the sprint name, status badge,\nrich-text goal, and start/end dates (reusing SprintManagement.vue''s\nstatus color and date-range patterns), plus an expand/collapse toggle\nthat mirrors TaskGroup''s own auto-expand-on-active-task behavior.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522c08afd1debb24aa023\n\n* feat(backlogs): sort sprint rows by status (active, planned, completed)\n\nOrder sprint rows using Sprint.status so active sprints surface first;\nthe no-sprint bucket is always appended last regardless of sort order.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522c88afd1debb24aa024","tree":{"sha":"36af9c7cae770f541d0402620a713a064315da69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/36af9c7cae770f541d0402620a713a064315da69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/69f5afb5fb21afbe58d9a533f212fefb1f74ce85","verification":{"payload":"tree 36af9c7cae770f541d0402620a713a064315da69\nparent fb2ee2120058dd5c6f1aac97c1fed24636dbe61c\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1785048650 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785048650 +0700\n\nBacklogs: group tasks into sprint rows (#22)\n\n* feat(backlogs): group backlog tasks by sprint into rows\n\nAdd BacklogSprintRow and a sprintGroups computed in BacklogsPage that\nbuckets parent tasks by sprintId, so each fetched sprint renders as its\nown row instead of a single flat task list.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522bd8afd1debb24aa021\n\n* feat(backlogs): give the no-sprint bucket a dedicated Backlog row\n\nStyle the sprintId===null row distinctly (dashed separator, muted\nitalic label) and show an explicit empty state so it always reads as\na dedicated bucket rather than just another sprint.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522be8afd1debb24aa022\n\n* feat(backlogs): add collapsible sprint row headers with goal/dates/status\n\nEach sprint row now shows a header with the sprint name, status badge,\nrich-text goal, and start/end dates (reusing SprintManagement.vue''s\nstatus color and date-range patterns), plus an expand/collapse toggle\nthat mirrors TaskGroup''s own auto-expand-on-active-task behavior.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522c08afd1debb24aa023\n\n* feat(backlogs): sort sprint rows by status (active, planned, completed)\n\nOrder sprint rows using Sprint.status so active sprints surface first;\nthe no-sprint bucket is always appended last regardless of sort order.\n\nTASKBOLT-6a5522c88afd1debb24aa024","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZa5KCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP98QAE+SitUmMZ3s5b1L/Vsn7hGc\nf2mJy7HS95IGLmVn2E8Pqw+AC4GndKrdEH23qCP1etx4lojKo+UK3vk8LilVNY+A\nlovdHUEvQexkXviVZOwbdzF9xCzLY/EjWUu5tktZ+OWykJgt0ENz90G7PDbBdTcC\nmEtIaELQ5meELnUHymMBcrMw+KeL4LzaVYL3jrhGcgGps7wqrOxlmyyeShsfyPhu\nmYlpQrX7VFkfJWX7vXQRam5YTSlI2u+drlfjqnr4kkLJjK2yxVCB19f4J6K+VuIp\nz+b6obX8PwxjomSfzYupzWja+hzUI4uTg+5H+aMx3Qy54NttkUWWzVo7HKQsKztH\nPW4qCgIv4ucepg0rXthimt503WUkoglaNwvTPyh5TRB4FGONGgbxxPBbnegP280f\nTV4PwkSzonamAw4lob9uBLLbA1YzD/md/lpbXHMuSEaJnzKYRPGCFlNPH5cSiRLf\nZUk2LkqJlbeT0cwvrk