9641/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:50:30Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:50:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(6a64ce0d27ec988310fa8fcc): project-scoped URL routing for deep-linking (#20)\n\nhome, active-sprint, backlogs, and reports now carry the selected\nproject''s id in the URL (/:projectId?/backlogs?task=abc) via a new\nuseProjectRouteSync() composable, kept bidirectionally in sync with the\nsidebar''s shared selectedProjectId context. Sidebar/AppLayout navigate\nby route name and preserve the current project; Configure keeps its\nown separate :projectId semantics. TaskLinkPage''s redirect now carries\nthe resolved project into the URL too.","tree":{"sha":"b2d4242dde5b012318eaafa522acfd67556bf22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/b2d4242dde5b012318eaafa522acfd67556bf22c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/d72a6f060f916f7cffb484ef30b363dadb1c9641","verification":{"payload":"tree b2d4242dde5b012318eaafa522acfd67556bf22c\nparent 7dbb4e1d60018da191ba62682c8a526b026d7c44\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1784994630 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784994630 +0700\n\nfeat(6a64ce0d27ec988310fa8fcc): project-scoped URL routing for deep-linking (#20)\n\nhome, active-sprint, backlogs, and reports now carry the selected\nproject''s id in the URL (/:projectId?/backlogs?task=abc) via a new\nuseProjectRouteSync() composable, kept bidirectionally in sync with the\nsidebar''s shared selectedProjectId context. Sidebar/AppLayout navigate\nby route name and preserve the current project; Configure keeps its\nown separate :projectId semantics. TaskLinkPage''s redirect now carries\nthe resolved project into the URL too.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZNtGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuzoQAGsmxFWG/1fS+rIKVoZ0QcYo\nTlnrTuwtk2aqWPOLnsEtXm