e":"2026-07-20T16:59:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"wip(6a5dd55f96f04b8c6ebf2c71): project/task deep-link routing (#16)\n\nIn progress — not yet opened as a PR. Implemented so far:\n- /configure/:projectId? syncs the sidebar''s shared selectedProjectId\n  context with the URL bidirectionally (ConfigureHomePage.vue).\n- New /tasks/:taskId route (TaskLinkPage.vue) resolves a bare task id\n  to its project, sets the shared context, and redirects into Backlogs\n  with ?task=<id> pre-selecting it (BacklogsPage.vue reads that query\n  param on load).\n- getTaskById() added to task.service.ts.\n- TaskDetailHeader''s \"copy task ID\" now copies a /tasks/:taskId deep\n  link instead of the bare id.\n- Tests added for all of the above (ConfigureHomePage, TaskLinkPage,\n  BacklogsPage, TaskDetailHeader) — full suite passing (34/34).\n\nRemaining before PR: manual browser verification of the full\ndeep-link flow (copy link -> open in new tab -> lands on the right\nproject + task), lint/build pass, and a final review of the\nAppSidebar project-switcher to make sure it doesn''t fight the new\nroute-driven navigation on ConfigureHomePage.","tree":{"sha":"474f402d5519de9cc146b35b9bc5f6e2ae7907b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/474f402d5519de9cc146b35b9bc5f6e2ae7907b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/b8287680a2da0a3cc0a657c612ea183a92ce7e80","verification":{"payload":"tree 474f402d5519de9cc146b35b9bc5f6e2ae7907b7\nparent 1933ab18887ff089b099edf0a7ed4611037c1beb\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1784566792 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784566792 +0700\n\nwip(6a5dd55f96f04b8c6ebf2c71): project/task deep-link routing (#16)\n\nIn progress — not yet opened as a PR. Implemented so far:\n- /configure/:projectId? syncs the sidebar''s shared selectedProjectId\n  context with the URL bidirectionally (ConfigureHomePage.vue).\n- New /tasks/:taskId route (TaskLinkPage.vue) resolves a bare task id\n  to its project, sets the shared context, and redirects into Backlogs\n  with ?task=<id> pre-selecting it (BacklogsPage.vue reads that query\n  param on load).\n- getTaskById() added to task.service.ts.\n- TaskDetailHeader''s \"copy task ID\" now copies a /tasks/:taskId deep\n  link instead of the bare id.\n- Tests added for all of the above (ConfigureHomePage, TaskLinkPage,\n  BacklogsPage, TaskDetailHeader) — full suite passing (34/34).\n\nRemaining before PR: manual browser verification of the full\ndeep-link flow (copy link -> open in new tab -> lands on the right\nproject + task), lint/build pass, and a final review of the\nAppSidebar project-switcher to make sure it doesn''t fight the new\nroute-driven navigation on ConfigureHomePage.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXlQICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAss0QAESsry2MuyKLt+OBUWpQ4IJ9\nIIr/ku6zS9oixecLrW+cVTTlVzqmfAXAxsf3eEjfMcx3iMqXJiDG8N0BO9RvMK3v\nMWREb0fqSBsrVuf5QITujbQLIcPHNnbSvuoEVibq2NvoVzMdGRLDTcC+22pz7gVY\nyUMpy4pVlOmCNyZhTxvTCF4gCOtQ4/In9sNlOSpCBzdXK+Ja+V2GE4ywZNeM5qFB\nkR4T3AY4JIPvIRFZ1Yqold17r+yZwSvB2zwRKI+wSlsxZMC4bSQvae7d2O4AYDew\nFHcPu1ZR5S42HtxS604TjLiqMhhNjnbMHrXQPh4COEPVDpyjUONjaaw5SmNakU6H\nmDVxBqQtfyPxChKDAzKvjwsjbJ4aXNtVwFhPbqAPqNpiwm0Zv0CT9Qkf/UP3H+yU\nX2aG+K+AR2olR+PeZE4Z/SLJF211ZJJ2iitqYvTyi1tExIejJnuccmYopoyvM+Z/\nZhTq4cnOOtFpT9VLBhnQ3GBdQEOYuNshZ/BkKW5WPc7hZfWopmnBRpYfOrSvsdV/\n6n779xQOAqOFbqP9H5ZpSveoxbS4J91CAigkZB2Ql7Fm5cqzdOp2kozvTfNF/gyB\nbTxJcxP2/U6yvec7OhimjjeT54PQm6BRtHSNIAMU6ll+hLNZ+K/QbLvpEA6UCsf5\nqE0CacM9f9jRQ1tJ5suJ\n=Q0/H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T16:59:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: