796f04b8c6ebf2c6c): allow clearing a task''s sprint (#12)\n\nThe Sprint Select in TaskFormFields only ever listed existing sprints,\nso once a task had a sprint assigned there was no way back to \"no\nsprint\" — reka-ui''s SelectItem also disallows an empty-string value,\nso a plain empty option wouldn''t have worked anyway. Adds a \"No\nsprint\" sentinel item and maps it to sprintId: null on submit (the\nbackend already supports clearing via null).","tree":{"sha":"b6564ea3524c7ff4f733c17f677f2bbdf61d00ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/b6564ea3524c7ff4f733c17f677f2bbdf61d00ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/41ef56b616360b79ac0e62d2ec3859b14a2fe84e","verification":{"payload":"tree b6564ea3524c7ff4f733c17f677f2bbdf61d00ed\nparent ccf69cdae40e4d7cf574480ae971f1fba68b5f25\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1784565041 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784565041 +0700\n\nfix(6a5dcb4796f04b8c6ebf2c6c): allow clearing a task''s sprint (#12)\n\nThe Sprint Select in TaskFormFields only ever listed existing sprints,\nso once a task had a sprint assigned there was no way back to \"no\nsprint\" — reka-ui''s SelectItem also disallows an empty-string value,\nso a plain empty option wouldn''t have worked anyway. Adds a \"No\nsprint\" sentinel item and maps it to sprintId: null on submit (the\nbackend already supports clearing via null).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXk0xCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArwAQAA+9ySMEuNx2zX23yC7mCEts\nanJnDo5yxDKfiT4Yq5ch/7lnR+tQJAVVPq+HSNKdRLiYJ4/BcTK01liWmmrFAYk2\n2+2gmt8A4Geoxb1vc6Sj8133+HQk3o39eiXwyfjl6CipAa5f0kh2kxwh/xPgv697\nmnNnUd+NgHPhMQMElN3OpHAxhFNrQaVI4rvJHiHweQkHMjOQVCV8NJoGkEaKgoKz\n/fgYPS7lYb71ZNtcI4Q/0ICAxP2+FA5iPkepuIxAg0spvLsehtFwRphwbEPJTIim\n1UR4Mzz+gnn9nmofflAF9P2mcRqMxFo3Pmy7z/Qpd1QzsigW106sLPw8MBACExQH\n16nS4oS01BtX9wLZRO4VijDh0jU51F17mRvElkOOfZOYoi10re16Bd5gb78UCBxN\n4biagJUzBw+5s6Ywhx2th6/r6k/Zm1VJANJ9nv