{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuanhuydev","id":68178042,"login":"tuanhuydev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc4MDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/74a7dc67524e67473ffe0853fbd0b84804f2df26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:11:47Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:11:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(6a54b55b8afd1debb24aa00b): add CLOSED task status end-to-end (#15)\n\nCovers all four sub-tasks:\n- Add CLOSED to TaskStatus + i18n labels (en/vi) — auto-appears in\n  TaskFormFields'' status Select since it''s derived from\n  Object.values(TaskStatus).\n- Visual treatment: a distinct slate status-dot color in\n  TaskItemStatus.vue, and the DONE opacity/strikethrough treatment in\n  TaskGroup.vue and TaskItem.vue now also applies to CLOSED.\n- Active Sprint Kanban: CLOSED tasks are filtered out of the board\n  (and its points totals) entirely rather than given a 4th column —\n  they''re obsoleted work, not something to work through this sprint.\n- Backlogs: closed tasks are hidden by default behind a new \"Show\n  closed tasks\" checkbox, since they''re no longer actionable but\n  shouldn''t be deleted.","tree"