s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuanhuydev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/commits/5b6837e3d2bdc05182d4ef9a960cad1f0115432c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:37:36Z","email":"tuanhuydev@gmail.com","name":"tuanhuydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:37:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature/taskbolt bugs rich text select (#8)\n\n* fix(6a54aeb18afd1debb24aa003): forward members and sprints into task create form\n\n* fix(6a54ae6e8afd1debb24aa002): show comment author for personal tasks, add rich text support (6a54b9438afd1debb24aa00d)\n\nComment authors outside a project had no member list to resolve against\nand always fell back to \"Unknown user\". Fall back to the current user''s\nid from the JWT so self-authored comments resolve correctly.\n\nAlso extracts the markdown renderer to a shared util and swaps the\nplain-text comment input for the rich text MarkdownEditor.\n\n* feat(6a54b41b8afd1debb24aa00a): add empty state to select component\n\n* feat(6a551e4b8afd1debb24aa011): support rich text for sprint goal","tree":{"sha":"aed49dae7d1a12eb6db83fd753e34eba3fa0de08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/aed49dae7d1a12eb6db83fd753e34eba3fa0de08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/5b6837e3d2bdc05182d4ef9a960cad1f0115432c","verification":{"payload":"tree aed49dae7d1a12eb6db83fd753e34eba3fa0de08\nparent 53a95d16aca1deaad90cf8e3061864bbf7bf2b81\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1783964256 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783964256 +0700\n\nFeature/taskbolt bugs rich text select (#8)\n\n* fix(6a54aeb18afd1debb24aa003): forward members and sprints into task create form\n\n* fix(6a54ae6e8afd1debb24aa002): show comment author for personal tasks, add rich text support (6a54b9438afd1debb24aa00d)\n\nComment authors outside a project had no member list to resolve against\nand always fell back to \"Unknown user\". Fall back to the current user''s\nid from the JWT so self-authored comments resolve correctly.\n\nAlso extracts the markdown renderer to a shared util and swaps the\nplain-text comment input for the rich text MarkdownEditor.\n\n* feat(6a54b41b8afd1debb24aa00a): add empty state to select component\n\n* feat(6a551e4b8afd1debb24aa011): support rich text for sprint goal","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVSJgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARJ4QAGk3bVTOQzz646ZSdgGAEBgK\nOkT2ftS97e0CEgnXiRb6n72TRaQ18cS6U0u9lyh79+N8sK64pSpqtdKtkQ9nY2Ya\nUmLFT8pzKLUR4lBrsC9eGMOJ6dMbgf9+f2ZILq7gtWzDZMBHGwEX3jG6TpjUoqcw\n/dnuZ0s48bEqmqOPbFCTeUi0MPHS00btTcUq21pZnl6Qo4kANxtCZcSNT4cdz3rB\nSoK+0oUiRnPXCI0AEv4EgekQEU9PJOrBwY13rK1q+v94LOxEk2sV85R01pR6r1Jb\nHriUesJlWbH1wTjAMGstYZZekFADeFgqEDu0rS5XBpYfyh9vQc2Zyjj6TvLWxocS\n9dCB//LI1R6z2i77YuDrp6RiJFoP+QtxSOLyKYVrc46z/9efWLj4kXn9YZzD3ynE\n0FRGekUgEt7Z1rXBb+6XAnqsUaiC6ObcJM0ysOQRskVEZaI2tdwkBp6pw4Rp3eCm\nreZH2HNwtklSVbYeF0hgSlAZgsiXZoMwu56wp1WbLsdkyLPAutBujF8QnFDxDY69\nTVj3bM+PiPIxaT1SCNtKIcOJFtY21d/2VUR2MVZBVrntDqvE2Y6zIEnwlMn72chn\n1UUnaPf9dSY5lkqNDtLzNPSRW3+oa37CyElV9y/iVpf4d1S9CuqemYim80tTtI4y\npC/M0qtHEuYF/GHYYjIO\n=cBhX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T17:37:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864