r & role management\n\n- Add createProject API service and CreateProjectPayload type\n- Add ''Add Project'' button and create flow in ConfigurePage\n- Make ProjectForm/ProjectFormFields reusable for create and edit modes\n- Add ProjectMember types with MemberRole enum (OWNER, ADMIN, MEMBER, VIEWER)\n- Add member API services (get, add, update role, remove)\n- Add ProjectMemberManagement component with add/edit/remove actions\n- Add MemberForm drawer for adding/editing project members\n- Integrate member management into ProjectDetailPage","tree":{"sha":"89199e746b1fd82dfd80a6cb87ecb2d8e04683bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/trees/89199e746b1fd82dfd80a6cb87ecb2d8e04683bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuanhuydev/taskbolt/git/commits/b6e0d441637966e936a79ca38ebfb55a4dc1feb1","verification":{"payload":"tree 89199e746b1fd82dfd80a6cb87ecb2d8e04683bb\nparent 7504c0a79e3607b5652454551997c08020946869\nauthor tuanhuydev <tuanhuydev@gmail.com> 1780848920 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780848920 +0700\n\nAdd project management feature with sprint support (#6)\n\n* feat(project-management): add project management feature with sprint support\n\n- Add ProjectList to ConfigurePage showing clickable project cards with status badges\n- Add ProjectDetailPage with full project info, edit form (drawer), and sprint management\n- Add SprintManagement component with create/edit/delete sprints per project\n- Add sprint.service.ts (getSprints, createSprint, updateSprint, deleteSprint)\n- Extend project.service.ts with updateProject()\n- Add Sprint, UpdateProjectPayload types\n- Add project-detail route (/configure/projects/:projectId)\n- Add i18n translations for project/sprint sections (en + vi)\n- Set up Vitest with 24 passing tests (services + components)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(project-management): add create project, member & role management\n\n- Add createProject API service an