TURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-03T14:53:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mndy/commit/02299af803b7d7688f967e0d5b1fe748368f7930","node_id":"C_kwDOQOHO_doAKDAyMjk5YWY4MDNiN2Q3Njg4Zjk2N2UwZDViMWZlNzQ4MzY4Zjc5MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mndy/commit/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c","sha":"634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mndy/commit/f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718","sha":"f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718"}],"sha":"02299af803b7d7688f967e0d5b1fe748368f7930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/02299af803b7d7688f967e0d5b1fe748368f7930"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95277988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot","id":95277988,"login":"stiproot","node_id":"U_kgDOBa3TpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:50:16Z","email":"stipcich.simon@gmail.com","name":"stiproot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:50:26Z","email":"stipcich.simon@gmail.com","name":"stiproot"},"message":"feat: per-session brand switching for the analytics MCPs\n\nLet an agent target a specific brand''s GA4 property and Meta ad account\nwithout restarting any server, by passing the per-call overrides those\ntools already accept (propertyId / adAccountId).\n\n- brands skill: resolves a brand from a JSON registry (MNDY_BRANDS_FILE ->\n  ./mndy-brands.json -> ~/.mndy/brands.json), holds it for the session, and\n  applies its IDs per call. Ships its own mndy-brands.example.json so the\n  template travels with the plugin.\n- ga4-analytics, meta-ads, shopify, mndy-mcps skills: brand-selection\n  sections. Shopify is called out as single-store per running server (its\n  tools have no store param), so a mismatched brand is reported rather than\n  silently answered with another store''s numbers.\n- meta-token skill + refresh-meta-token --verify: diagnose an expired token\n  via debug_token (works on expired tokens), and document the System User\n  token as the permanent fix.\n- refresh-meta-token: a new token that cannot be verified is no longer\n  written to .env; --no-verify is the escape hatch. The gate guards only the\n  write, so --dry-run still prints.\n- gitignore the real brand registry; keep the example committed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62d6d64a09e2d160584cd809320c1d5ad34d430f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/git/trees/62d6d64a09e2d160584cd809320c1d5ad34d430f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/git/commits/f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95277988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot","id":95277988,"login":"stiproot","node_id":"U_kgDOBa3TpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mndy/commit/f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718","node_id":"C_kwDOQOHO_doAKGY4NmU1ZmU0YjFiNzE5ZWY2MzI3MjUzY2EyZDg2MDFlOTkyNGQ3MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mndy/commit/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c","sha":"634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c"}],"sha":"f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/f86e5fe4b1b719ef6327253ca2d8601e9924d718"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95277988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot","id":95277988,"login":"stiproot","node_id":"U_kgDOBa3TpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/commits/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T09:08:45Z","email":"stipcich.simon@gmail.com","name":"stiproot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T09:08:45Z","email":"stipcich.simon@gmail.com","name":"stiproot"},"message":"feat: mndy-mcp plugin for MCP usage\n\nAdd a minimal, installable Claude Code plugin that wires the mndy MCP\nservers into agent sessions and documents how to use them.\n\n- plugin-marketplace/: marketplace + mndy-mcp plugin with a bundled\n  .mcp.json (HTTP servers, env-overridable URLs) and one usage skill\n  per server (github-issues, ga4, meta-ads, shopify, dapr) plus an\n  orientation skill.\n- Enable the plugin repo-wide via .claude/settings.json and remove the\n  now-redundant .claude/mcp.json so the plugin is the single source of\n  MCP wiring.\n- Makefile: add run-analytics-mcps to start GA4, Meta Ads, and Shopify\n  together (no infra required).\n- docs: update mcp-testing guide to reference the plugin.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uo5uM41N63mEYgvVs3yFJC","tree":{"sha":"27d56f178217c2fc63ab1f5f11fff80e32418861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/git/trees/27d56f178217c2fc63ab1f5f11fff80e32418861"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stiproot/mndy/git/commits/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95277988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot","id":95277988,"login":"stiproot","node_id":"U_kgDOBa3TpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stiproot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mndy/commit/634167576fdf2efb541c2d7d7a3e9514d5bd3d9c","node_id":"C_kwDOQOHO_doAKDYzNDE2NzU3NmZkZjJlZmI1NDFjMmQ3ZDdhM2U5NTE0ZDViZDNkOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stiproot/mnd